"},{"@language":"cs-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Komplexní geodetická páteř v rovinách a výškách."},{"@language":"da-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"En omfattende geodætisk rygrad i planer og højder."},{"@language":"de-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Ein umfassendes geodätisches Rückgrat in Ebenen und Höhen."},{"@language":"el-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Μια ολοκληρωμένη γεωδαιτική ραχοκοκαλιά σε επίπεδα και ύψη."},{"@language":"en-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"A comprehensive geodetic backbone in planes and heights."},{"@language":"es-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Una columna vertebral geodésica integral en planos y alturas."},{"@language":"et-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Terviklik geodeetiline selgroog lennukites ja kõrgustes."},{"@language":"fi-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Kattava geodeettinen selkäranka lentokoneissa ja korkeuksissa."},{"@language":"fr-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Une colonne vertébrale géodésique complète dans les plans et les hauteurs."},{"@language":"ga-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Cnámh droma geodetic cuimsitheach i plánaí agus airde."},{"@language":"hr-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Sveobuhvatna geodetska okosnica u ravninama i visinama."},{"@language":"hu-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Átfogó geodéziai gerinc repülőgépekben és magasságokban."},{"@language":"it-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Una spina dorsale geodetica completa in piani e altezze."},{"@language":"lt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Visapusiškas geodezinis pagrindas plokštumose ir aukščiuose."},{"@language":"lv-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Visaptverošs ģeodēziskais mugurkauls plaknēs un augstumos."},{"@language":"mt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Bażi ġeodetika komprensiva fil-pjani u l-għoli."},{"@language":"nl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Een uitgebreide geodetische ruggengraat in vliegtuigen en hoogtes."},{"@language":"pl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Kompleksowy kręgosłup geodezyjny w płaszczyznach i wysokościach."},{"@language":"pt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Uma espinha dorsal geodésica abrangente em aviões e alturas."},{"@language":"ro-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"O coloană vertebrală geodezică cuprinzătoare în planuri și înălțimi."},{"@language":"sk-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Komplexná geodetická chrbtica v lietadlách a výškach."},{"@language":"sl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Celovita geodetska hrbtenica v ravninah in višinah."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ett heltäckande geodetiskt stomnät i plan och höjd."},{"@language":"uk-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Комплексний геодезичний хребет в площинах і висотах."}],"dct:identifier":"ds_gs_stompunkt_p_befintlig","dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"https://dataportal.se/concepts/licensecategories/nolicense"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2120000068"},"dct:spatial":{"@id":"http://sws.geonames.org/2704619"},"dct:subject":{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/TopicCategory/location"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"bg-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Точки от основната мрежа"},{"@language":"cs-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Body hlavní sítě"},{"@language":"da-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Hovednetpunkter"},{"@language":"de-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Kernnetzpunkte"},{"@language":"el-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Σημεία κεντρικού δικτύου"},{"@language":"en-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Core network points"},{"@language":"es-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Puntos de la red básica"},{"@language":"et-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Põhivõrgupunktid"},{"@language":"fi-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Ydinverkkopisteet"},{"@language":"fr-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Points de réseau central"},{"@language":"ga-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Pointí croíghréasáin"},{"@language":"hr-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Točke osnovne mreže"},{"@language":"hu-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Törzshálózati pontok"},{"@language":"it-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Punti della rete centrale"},{"@language":"lt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Pagrindinio tinklo taškai"},{"@language":"lv-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Pamattīkla punkti"},{"@language":"mt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Punti ewlenin tan-netwerk"},{"@language":"nl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@va