":{"@id":"mailto:robin.mangs@skatteverket.se"},"foaf:name":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Skatteverket"},"foaf:page":{"@id":"https://www.skatteverket.se"},"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#sameAs":[{"@id":"https://skatteverket.entryscape.net/store/29/resource/1"},{"@id":"https://skatteverket.se"}]},{"@id":"https://skatteverket.entryscape.net/store/9/resource/1475","@type":"dcat:Dataset","dcat:keyword":[{"@language":"sv","@value":"Privatperson, Fysisk person, Folkbokföring"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"folkbokföring"}],"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/GOVE"},"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/RESTRICTED"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/CONT"},"dct:description":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Avtal med Skatteverket krävs. Uppgifter om fysiska personer som endast är avsedda för myndigheter, kommuner och regioner är bland annat namn, personnummer/samordningsnummer, skyddade personuppgifter, kön, adress, födelse, civilstånd, familjerelationer, medborgarskap, avregistrering.  \nGrunddatadomän Person ingår i ramverket för nationella grunddata."},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2021005448"},"dct:relation":{"@id":"https://www.skatteverket.se/offentligaaktorer/informationsutbyte/grunddatadomanperson.4.96cca41179bad4b1aa3eb2.html?q=grunddatadom%C3%A4n+person"},"dct:title":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Grunddatadomän Person"}}],"@id":"urn:source:4b43ca8e1959b64e1acfdd356b61155d35c8b6daa48d8c9f39a62cae03af2624"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:4be49fbd3e4f2fcb9f01a317be34d891678c2cd2b1d1d50edd745c6a3df8ecbf_b0n0","@type":"dct:Location","dcat:bbox":{"@type":"http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral","@value":"POLYGON((17.7605 59.4434,18.2011 59.4434,18.2011 59.2272,17.7605 59.2272,17.7605 59.4434))"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/locn#geometry":{"@type":"http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral","@value":"POLYGON((17.7605 59.4434,18.2011 59.4434,18.2011 59.2272,17.7605 59.2272,17.7605 59.4434))"}},{"@id":"_:4be49fbd3e4f2fcb9f01a317be34d891678c2cd2b1d1d50edd745c6a3df8ecbf_b1n0","@type":"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#Checksum","http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#algorithm":{"@id":"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksumAlgorithm_md5"},"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksumValue":"160d9502dcea1d25a3e8c6e98b4a0fcd66"},{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/88u/dataset/76f2c008-1d71-473b-bd24-7a499293d711","@type":["dcat:Dataset","dcat:dataset"],"dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://resources.stockholm.se/metadata#vcard/Stockholms+stad+-+Milj%C3%B6f%C3%B6rvaltningen/"},"dcat:distribution":[{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/88u/distribution/1910be9f-e78d-4050-8574-8e739a04b1d2"},{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/88u/distribution/7b7fa2c7-bd5c-451b-83a2-1a54f46c7618"},{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/88u/distribution/ed23b171-80b4-489b-9df5-db8cc033432d"}],"dcat:keyword":[{"@language":"sv","@value":"Extern dataportal"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Fullständiga metadata"}],"dcat:landingPage":{"@id":"https://dataportalen.stockholm.se/dataportalen/GetMetaDataById?id=003c9649-91fd-4ae0-9958-a335c6b77b13"},"dcat:theme":[{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/HEAL"},{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/SOCI"}],"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/RESTRICTED"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/DAILY"},"dct:created":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"1998-01-01"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"bg-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Надзорни дейности, свързани с надзора на храните, от деловодната система на администрацията по околна среда, ECOS 2. Данните се актуализират ежеседмично."},{"@language":"cs-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Dozorové činnosti související s dozorem nad potravinami ze systému správy případů Ekologické správy, ECOS 2. Data jsou aktualizována každý týden."},{"@language":"da-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Tilsynsaktiviteter i forbindelse med fødevaretilsyn fra Miljøstyrelsens sagsstyringssystem, ECOS 2. Data opdateres ugentligt."},{"@language":"de-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Überwachungstätigkeiten im Zusammenhang mit der Lebensmittelüberwachung aus dem Fallbearbeitungssystem der Umweltverwaltung, ECOS 2. Die Daten werden wöchentlich aktualisiert."},{"@language":"el-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Δραστηριότητες εποπτείας, που σχετίζονται με την εποπτεία των τροφίμων, από το σύστημα διαχείρισης υποθέσεων της Περιβαλλοντικής Διοίκησης, ECOS 2. Τα δεδομένα ενημερώνονται εβδομαδιαίως."},{"@language":"en-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Supervision activities, related to food supervision, from the Environmental Administration's case management system, ECOS 2. Data is updated weekly."},{"@language":"es-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Actividades de supervisión, relacionadas con la supervisión alimentaria, desde el sistema de gestión de casos de la Administración Ambiental, ECOS 2. Los datos se actualizan semanalmente."},{"@language":"et-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Toidujärelevalvega seotud järelevalvetegevus Keskkonnaameti juhtumikorralduse süsteemist ECOS 2. Andmeid uuendatakse iga nädal."},{"@language":"fi-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Elintarvikevalvontaan liittyvät valvontatoimet Ympäristöhallinnon asianhallintajärjestelmästä, ECOS 2. Tiedot päivitetään viikoittain."},{"@language":"fr-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Activités de supervision, liées à la supervision des aliments, du système de gestion des cas de l'Administration de l'environnement, ECOS 2. Les données sont mises à jour chaque semaine."},{"@language":"ga-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Gníomhaíochtaí maoirseachta, a bhaineann le maoirseacht bia, ó chóras bainistithe cásanna an Riaracháin Comhshaoil, ECOS 2. Déantar na sonraí a nuashonrú go seachtainiúil."},{"@language":"hr-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Nadzorne aktivnosti povezane s nadzorom hrane iz sustava vođenja predmeta Uprave za okoliš, ECOS 2. Podaci se ažuriraju svaki tjedan."},{"@language":"hu-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Az élelmiszer-felügyelethez kapcsolódó felügyeleti tevékenységek a Környezetvédelmi Igazgatóság ügyviteli rendszeréből, ECOS 2. Az adatok hetente frissülnek."},{"@language":"it-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Attività di supervisione, relative alla supervisione alimentare, dal sistema di gestione dei casi dell'Amministrazione Ambientale, ECOS 2. I dati vengono aggiornati settimanalmente."},{"@language":"lt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Priežiūros veikla, susijusi su maisto produktų priežiūra, iš Aplinkos apsaugos administracijos bylų valdymo sistemos, ECOS 2. Duomenys atnaujinami kas savaitę."},{"@language":"lv-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Uzraudzības darbības, kas saistītas ar pārtikas uzraudzību, no Vides pārvaldes lietu pārvaldības sistēmas, ECOS 2. Dati tiek atjaunināti katru nedēļu."},{"@language":"mt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Attivitajiet ta’ superviżjoni, relatati mas-superviżjoni tal-ikel, mis-sistema ta’ ġestjoni tal-każijiet tal-Amministrazzjoni Ambjentali, ECOS 2. Id-data tiġi aġġornata kull ġimgħa."},{"@language":"nl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Toezichtactiviteiten, met betrekking tot voedseltoezicht, vanuit het casemanagementsysteem van de Milieuadministratie, ECOS 2. De gegevens worden wekelijks bijgewerkt."},{"@language":"pl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Działania nadzorcze związane z nadzorem nad żywnością, z systemu zarządzania sprawami Administracji Środowiska, ECOS 2. Dane są aktualizowane co tydzień."},{"@language":"pt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Atividades de supervisão, relacionadas com a supervisão alimentar, do sistema de gestão de processos da Administração Ambiental, ECOS 2. Os dados são atualizados semanalmente."},{"@language":"ro-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Activități de supraveghere, legate de supravegherea alimentelor, din sistemul de management de caz al Administrației de Mediu, ECOS 2. Datele sunt actualizate săptămânal."},{"@language":"sk-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Dozorné činnosti súvisiace s dohľadom nad potravinami zo systému správy prípadov environmentálnej správy, ECOS 2. Údaje sa aktualizujú týždenne."},{"@language":"sl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Nadzorne dejavnosti, povezane z nadzorom hrane, iz sistema vodenja zadev Uprave za okolje, ECOS 2. Podatki se posodabljajo tedensko."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Tillsynverksamheter, rörande livsmedelstillsyn, från miljöförvaltningens ärendehanteringssystem, Ecos 2. Data uppdateras veckovis."},{"@language":"uk-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Нагляд за діяльністю, пов'язаною з наглядом за продуктами харчування, з системи управління справами Управління навколишнього середовища, ECOS 2. Дані оновлюються щотижня."}],"dct:format":"text/html","dct:identifier":"76f2c008-1d71-473b-bd24-7a499293d711","dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"https://dataportal.se/concepts/licensecategories/otherlicense"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-04-15"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2120000142"},"dct:spatial":{"@id":"_:4be49fbd3e4f2fcb9f01a317be34d891678c2cd2b1d1d50edd745c6a3df8ecbf_b0n0"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"bg-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Надзорна дейност - Хранителни продукти"},{"@language":"cs-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Činnosti v oblasti dohledu – potraviny"},{"@language":"da-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Tilsynsaktiviteter - Fødevarer"},{"@language":"de-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Überwachungstätigkeiten - Lebensmittel"},{"@language":"el-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Δραστηριότητες εποπτείας - Τρόφιμα"},{"@language":"en-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Supervision activities - Foodstuffs"},{"@language":"es-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Actividades de supervisión - Productos alimenticios"},{"@language":"et-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Järelevalvetegevus – toiduained"},{"@language":"fi-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Valvontatoiminta - Elintarvikkeet"},{"@language":"fr-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Activités de surveillance - Denrées alimentaires"},{"@language":"ga-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Gníomhaíochtaí maoirseachta - Earraí bia"},{"@language":"hr-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Nadzorne aktivnosti – prehrambeni proizvodi"},{"@language":"hu-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Felügyeleti tevékenységek – Élelmiszerek"},{"@language":"it-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Attività di supervisione - Prodotti alimentari"},{"@language":"lt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Maisto produktų priežiūros veikla"},{"@language":"lv-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Uzraudzības darbības – pārtikas produkti"},{"@language":"mt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"1 Attivitajiet ta' superviżjoni - Oġġetti tal-ikel"},{"@language":"nl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Toezichtactiviteiten - Voedingsmiddelen"},{"@language":"pl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Działania nadzorcze – środki spożywcze"},{"@language":"pt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Actividades de supervisão - Géneros alimentícios"},{"@language":"ro-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Activități de supraveghere - Produse alimentare"},{"@language":"sk-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Dozorné činnosti – potraviny"},{"@language":"sl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Nadzorne dejavnosti – živila"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Tillsynsverksamheter - Livsmedel"},{"@language":"uk-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Нагляд за діяльністю - Продукти харчування"}],"dct:type":{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/ResourceType/dataset"}},{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/88u/distribution/1910be9f-e78d-4050-8574-8e739a04b1d2","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://kontrollwiki.livsmedelsverket.se/artikel/194/riskklassning-av-livsmedelsanlaggningar-"},"dct:description":["Information om riskklassning av livsmedelsanläggningar och kontrolltid från Livsmedelsverket.",{"@language":"bg-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Информация за класификацията на риска на обектите за храни и времето за контрол от Националната агенция по храните."},{"@language":"cs-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Informace o klasifikaci rizik potravinářských zařízení a době kontroly od Národní agentury pro potraviny."},{"@language":"da-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Oplysninger om risikoklassificering af fødevarevirksomheder og kontroltid fra Fødevarestyrelsen."},{"@language":"de-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Informationen zur Risikoeinstufung von Lebensmittelbetrieben und Kontrollzeit der Nationalen Lebensmittelagentur."},{"@language":"el-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Πληροφορίες σχετικά με την ταξινόμηση κινδύνου των εγκαταστάσεων τροφίμων και τον χρόνο ελέγχου από την Εθνική Υπηρεσία Τροφίμων."},{"@language":"en-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Information on risk classification of food establishments and control time from the National Food Agency."},{"@language":"es-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Información de la Agencia Nacional de Alimentación sobre la clasificación de riesgos de los establecimientos alimentarios y el tiempo de control."},{"@language":"et-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Riiklikult toiduametilt saadud teave toidukäitlemisettevõtete riskiklassifikatsiooni ja kontrolliaja kohta."},{"@language":"fi-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Tiedot elintarvikealan laitosten riskiluokituksesta ja valvonta-ajasta Kansalliselta elintarvikevirastolta."},{"@language":"fr-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Informations sur la classification des risques des établissements alimentaires et le temps de contrôle fournies par l’Agence nationale de l’alimentation."},{"@language":"ga-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Faisnéis maidir le haicmiú riosca bunaíochtaí bia agus am rialaithe ón nGníomhaireacht Náisiúnta Bia."},{"@language":"hr-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Informacije Nacionalne agencije za hranu o klasifikaciji rizika objekata u poslovanju s hranom i vremenu kontrole."},{"@language":"hu-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Az élelmiszer-ipari létesítmények kockázati besorolására és az ellenőrzési időre vonatkozó információk a Nemzeti Élelmiszerügynökségtől."},{"@language":"it-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Informazioni sulla classificazione dei rischi degli stabilimenti alimentari e sul tempo di controllo da parte dell'Agenzia nazionale per gli alimenti."},{"@language":"lt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Nacionalinės maisto agentūros informacija apie maisto įmonių rizikos klasifikavimą ir kontrolės laiką."},{"@language":"lv-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Valsts pārtikas aģentūras informācija par pārtikas uzņēmumu riska klasifikāciju un kontroles laiku."},{"@language":"mt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Informazzjoni dwar il-klassifikazzjoni tar-riskju tal-istabbilimenti tal-ikel u l-ħin ta’ kontroll mill-Aġenzija Nazzjonali tal-Ikel."},{"@language":"nl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Informatie van het Nationaal Voedselagentschap over de risico-indeling van levensmiddeleninrichtingen en de controletijd."},{"@language":"pl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Informacje Krajowej Agencji ds. Żywności na temat klasyfikacji ryzyka zakładów spożywczych i czasu kontroli."},{"@language":"pt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Informações da Agência Alimentar Nacional sobre a classificação de risco dos estabelecimentos alimentares e o tempo de controlo."},{"@language":"ro-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Informații privind clasificarea în funcție de risc a unităților din sectorul alimentar și timpul de control furnizate de Agenția Națională pentru Alimentație."},{"@language":"sk-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Informácie o klasifikácii rizika potravinárskych prevádzkarní a čase kontroly od Národnej agentúry pre potraviny."},{"@language":"sl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Informacije o razvrstitvi živilskih obratov glede na tveganje in času nadzora, ki jih zagotovi nacionalna agencija za hrano."},{"@language":"uk-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Інформація про класифікацію ризиків закладів харчування та час контролю від Національного агентства продовольства."}],"dct:format":"text/html","dct:identifier":"https://resources.stockholm.se/data/76f2c008-1d71-473b-bd24-7a499293d711#HTTP:Information/1","dct:title":["Information från Livsmedelsverket",{"@language":"bg-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Информация от Националната агенция по храните"},{"@language":"cs-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Informace od Národní agentury pro potraviny"},{"@language":"da-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Oplysninger fra Fødevarestyrelsen"},{"@language":"de-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Informationen der National Food Agency"},{"@language":"el-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Ενημέρωση από την Εθνική Υπηρεσία Τροφίμων"},{"@language":"en-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Information from the National Food Agency"},{"@language":"es-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Información de la Agencia Nacional de Alimentación"},{"@language":"et-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Teave riiklikult toiduametilt"},{"@language":"fi-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Kansallisen elintarvikeviraston tiedotusasia"},{"@language":"fr-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Informations communiquées par l’Agence nationale de l’alimentation"},{"@language":"ga-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Eolas ón nGníomhaireacht Náisiúnta Bia"},{"@language":"hr-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Informacije Nacionalne agencije za hranu"},{"@language":"hu-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"A Nemzeti Élelmiszer-ügynökség tájékoztatója"},{"@language":"it-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Informazioni fornite dall'Agenzia nazionale per l'alimentazione"},{"@language":"lt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Nacionalinės maisto agentūros informacija"},{"@language":"lv-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Valsts pārtikas aģentūras sniegtā informācija"},{"@language":"mt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Informazzjoni mill-Aġenzija Nazzjonali tal-Ikel"},{"@language":"nl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Informatie van het Nationaal Voedselagentschap"},{"@language":"pl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Informacje przekazane przez Narodową Agencję Żywności"},{"@language":"pt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Informações da Agência Alimentar Nacional"},{"@language":"ro-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Informare din partea Agenției Naționale pentru Alimentație"},{"@language":"sk-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Informácie od Národnej agentúry pre potraviny"},{"@language":"sl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Informacije nacionalne agencije za hrano"},{"@language":"uk-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Інформація від Національного агентства продовольства"}],"foaf:primaryTopic":{"@id":