formaat biedt"},{"@language":"pl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"REST API dostarczający uporządkowane dane w formacie JSON"},{"@language":"pt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"API REST que fornece dados estruturados em formato JSON"},{"@language":"ro-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"REST API care furnizează date structurate în format JSON"},{"@language":"sk-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"REST API, ktoré poskytuje štruktúrované dáta vo formáte JSON"},{"@language":"sl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"REST API, ki zagotavlja strukturirane podatke v obliki JSON"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"REST API som ger strukturerad data i JSON-format"},{"@language":"uk-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"REST API, який надає структуровані дані у форматі JSON"}],"dct:format":"application/json","dct:identifier":"https://metadata.bolagsverket.se/store/2/resource/30","dct:title":[{"@language":"bg-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Цифрови правомощия на адвоката"},{"@language":"cs-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Digitální plná moc"},{"@language":"da-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Digitale fuldmagter"},{"@language":"de-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Digitale Vollmachten"},{"@language":"el-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Ψηφιακές πληρεξούσιες"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Electronic Power of Attorney"},{"@language":"es-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Poderes Digitales de Abogado"},{"@language":"et-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Advokaadi digitaalsed volitused"},{"@language":"fi-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Asianajajan digitaaliset valtuudet"},{"@language":"fr-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Procurations numériques"},{"@language":"ga-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Cumhachtaí Digiteacha Aturnae"},{"@language":"hr-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Digitalne ovlasti odvjetnika"},{"@language":"hu-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Digitális meghatalmazások"},{"@language":"it-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Poteri digitali dell'avvocato"},{"@language":"lt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Skaitmeniniai įgaliojimai"},{"@language":"lv-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Advokāta digitālās pilnvaras"},{"@language":"mt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Setgħat Diġitali tal-Avukati"},{"@language":"nl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Digitale volmachten"},{"@language":"pl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Cyfrowe uprawnienia adwokata"},{"@language":"pt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Procuração Digital"},{"@language":"ro-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Atribuțiile digitale ale avocatului"},{"@language":"sk-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Digitálne právomoci advokátov"},{"@language":"sl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Digitalna moč odvetnika"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Digitala fullmakter"},{"@language":"uk-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Цифрові довіреності"}],"foaf:primaryTopic":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/88u/distribution/2a98d670-8101-4841-b0b2-7fdc4e00f418"},"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability/stable"}},{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/88u/record/https-metadata-bolagsverket-se-store-2-resource-12","@type":"dcat:CatalogRecord","dcat:distribution":[{"@id":"_:63733137f7f23d6ef48822a1675e64ada99883fd7150a89b958e6388dd354f92_b1n0"},{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/88u/distribution/32d2604e-7510-4a7e-9c4d-36d5f8439bc1"}],"dct:creator":{"@id":"http://piveau.io"},"dct:identifier":"https://metadata.bolagsverket.se/store/2/resource/12","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-03-20T11:15:01Z"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-07-07T20:57:42Z"},"foaf:primaryTopic":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/88u/dataset/https-metadata-bolagsverket-se-store-2-resource-12"},"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksum":{"@id":"_:63733137f7f23d6ef48822a1675e64ada99883fd7150a89b958e6388dd354f92_b0n0"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/dqv#hasQualityMetadata":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/88u/metrics/https-metadata-bolagsverket-se-store-2-resource-12"},"https://europeandataportal.eu/voc#originalLanguage":"sv","https://europeandataportal.eu/voc#transIssued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-06-25T11:15:01Z"},"https://europeandataportal.eu/voc#transReceived":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-07-07T20:57:42Z"},"https://europeandataportal.eu/voc#transStatus":{"@id":"https://europeandataportal.eu/voc#TransCompleted"},"https://piveau.eu/ns/voc#originalId":"https://metadata.bolagsverket.se/store/2/resource/12","https://piveau.eu/ns/voc#originalURIRef":"https://metadata.bolagsverket.se/store/2/resource/12"},{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2021005489","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:description":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bolagsverket tillgängliggör datamängder som API:er och XML-paket för företagsinformation och avisering. Avgifter tas ut genom anslutningsavgift och löpande månads- eller årsavgift, beroende på tjänst och transaktioner. Avgiftens storlek varierar, men exempel är: t.ex. 5 000 kr i anslutningsavgift för XML-paket och en transaktionsbaserad löpande avgift; vissa tjänster är kostnadsfria för myndigheter, 250 kr/år för kommuner och regioner."},"dct:identifier":"2021005489","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/NationalAuthority"},"foaf:homepage":{"@id":"https://bolagsverket.se/"},"foaf:mbox":{"@id":"mailto:ssbt@bolagsverket.se"},"foaf:name":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bolagsverket"},"foaf:page":{"@id":"https://www.bolagsverket.se"},"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#sameAs":[{"@id":"https://bolagsverket.se/apierochoppnadata/apiforatthamtaforetagsinformation/dataset#creator"},{"@id":"https://bolagsverket.se/catalog#publisher"},{"@id":"https://bolagsverket.se/ssbtgo/dataset#creator"},{"@id":"https://bolagsverket.se/vardefulla-datamangder-api/dataset#creator"},{"@id":"https://bolagsverket.se/vardefulla-datamangder-bulkfil/dataset#creator"},{"@id":"https://bolagsverket.se/xmlpaket/dataset#creator"},{"@id":"https://metadata.bolagsverket.se/store/36/resource/1"},{"@id":"https://minaombud.se/dataset#creator"},{"@id":"https://www.bolagsverket.se/ssbt/dataset#creator"}],"https://www.w3.org/ns/org#classification":{"@id":"https://dataportal.se/concepts/orgAspects/feeFinanzing"}},{"@id":"https://metadata.bolagsverket.se/store/2/resource/22","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Organization","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"Mina ombud","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasAddress":{"@id":"_:63733137f7f23d6ef48822a1675e64ada99883fd7150a89b958e6388dd354f92_b2n0"},"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:minaombud@bolagsverket.se"},"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasTelephone":{"@id":"_:63733137f7f23d6ef48822a1675e64ada99883fd7150a89b958e6388dd354f92_b3n0"}},{"@id":"https://metadata.bolagsverket.se/store/2/resource/47","@type":["dcat:DataService","http://entryscape.com/terms/IndependentDataService"],"dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://metadata.bolagsverket.se/store/2/resource/22"},"dcat:endpointDescription":{"@id":"https://fullmakt.minaombud.se/dfm/formedlare/v2"},"dcat:endpointURL":{"@id":"https://fullmakt.minaombud.se/dfm/formedlare/v2"},"dcat:keyword":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Authority"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Power of Attorney"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Representative"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Behörighet"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"ENA"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Fullmakt"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ombud"}],"dcat:servesDataset":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/88u/dataset/https-metadata-bolagsverket-se-store-2-resource-12"},"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/RESTRICTED"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"REST API requests gives structured JSON formatted data in response"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"REST API som ger strukturerad data i JSON-format"}],"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Mina ombud"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Mina ombud"}],"dct:type":{"@id":"http://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q749568"}}],"@id":"urn:source:63733137f7f23d6ef48822a1675e64ada99883fd7150a89b958e6388dd354f92"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:6413d0c5cbab6b4c03d1e220ea1d8ea3012a17e771544fe1649534c388f637ea_b0n0","@type":"dct:Location","dcat:bbox":{"@type":"http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral","@value":"POLYGON((17.7605 59.4402,18.2011 59.4402,18.2011 59.2272,17.7605 59.2272,17.7605 59.4402))"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/locn#geometry":{"@type":"http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral","@value":"POLYGON((17.7605 59.4402,18.2011 59.4402,18.2011 59.2272,17.7605 59.2272,17.7605 59.4402))"}},{"@id":"_:6413d0c5cbab6b4c03d1e220ea1d8ea3012a17e771544fe1649534c388f637ea_b1n0","@type":"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#Checksum","http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#algorithm":{"@id":"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksumAlgorithm_md5"},"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksumValue":"123fce3ad17956f709fca3caa1dc2a9ab2"},{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/88u/dataset/6724fc99-fd4b-4418-bd23-b42e1be55a32","@type":["dcat:Dataset","dcat:dataset"],"dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://resources.stockholm.se/metadata#vcard/Stadsbyggnadskontoret+-+Stadsm%C3%A4tningsavdelningen+-+Geodatadistributionsenheten/"},"dcat:distribution":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/88u/distribution/180c2491-64b8-45e0-861a-66bd3bb9fb29"},"dcat:keyword":[{"@language":"sv","@value":"Extern dataportal"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Fullständiga metadata"}],"dcat:landingPage":{"@id":"https://dataportalen.stockholm.se/dataportalen/GetMetaDataById?id=e7c49f2a-8e24-4b37-8699-4f28771f48a9"},"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/TECH"},"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/RESTRICTED"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/CONT"},"dct:created":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"1992-01-01"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"bg-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Инфраструктурата се състои от следните обекти и подтипове (за текущия списък вж. базовата карта на общата продуктова спецификация): Релсова мрежа: 10, релсите на метрото; 20, SJ Нормална писта; 30, SJ Тесен коловоз; 60, трамвайни релси. Съоръжение за движение: 10, Navfollower; 20, Perrong; 50, мост; 60, тунел; 80, Теренно стълбище. Демаркация на пътя: 10, вход; На 20 години, Рефуг. Размножаване на пътищата: 10, Пътна илюстрация; 20, размножаване на паркоместата; 70, Разпространение на пътищата; 80, Разпространение на пътя в тунела."},{"@language":"cs-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Infrastruktura se skládá z následujících objektů a podtypů (aktuální seznam viz Základní mapa obecných specifikací produktu): Traťová síť: 10, trasy metra; 20, SJ normální dráha; 30, úzká trať SJ; 60, tramvajové tratě. Dopravní zařízení: 10, Navfollower; 20, Perrong; 50, můstek; 60, tunel; 80, Terénní schodiště. Vymezení silnice: 10, vstup; 20, Refugová. Šíření vozovky: 10, Silniční ilustrace; 20, šíření Parkway; 70, Šíření po silnici; 80, Šíření silnic v tunelu."},{"@language":"da-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Infrastrukturen består af følgende objekt- og undertyper (se basiskortet for den generelle produktspecifikation for den aktuelle liste): Spornet: 10, Metrospor 20, SJ Normal spor; 30, SJ smalsporet; 60, Sporvognsspor. Færdselsanlæg: 10, Navfollower; 20, Perrong; 50, bro; 60, tunnel, 80, Terræntrappe. Vejafgrænsning: 10, Indgang; 20, Refug. Udbredelse af veje: 10, vejillustration 20, Parkway-udbredelse; 70, Vejspredning 80, Vejspredning i tunnel."},{"@language":"de-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Infrastruktur besteht aus folgenden Objekten und Untertypen (für die aktuelle Liste siehe Basiskarte der allgemeinen Produktspezifikation): Streckennetz: 10, U-Bahn-Strecken; 20, SJ Normalschiene; 30, SJ Schmale Spur; 60, Straßenbahngleise. Verkehrseinrichtung: 10, Navfollower; 20, Perrong; 50, Brücke; 60, Tunnel; 80, Geländetreppe. Straßenabgrenzung: 10, Eingang; 20, Zuflucht. Straßenausbreitung: 10, Straßenillustration; 20, Parkway-Verbreitung; 70, Straßenausbreitung; 80, Straßenausbreitung im Tunnel."},{"@language":"el-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Η υποδομή αποτελείται από τα ακόλουθα αντικείμενα και υποτύπους (για τον τρέχοντα κατάλογο βλέπε χάρτη βάσης γενικών προδιαγραφών προϊόντος): Δίκτυο τροχιάς: 10, γραμμές μετρό· 20, κανονική τροχιά SJ· 30, στενή τροχιά SJ· 60, ίχνη του τραμ. Διευκόλυνση κυκλοφορίας: 10, Navfollower· 20, Perrong· 50, Γέφυρα· 60, σήραγγα· 80, Σκάλα εδάφους. Οριοθέτηση οδών: 10, είσοδος· 20, απόφευγε. Διάδοση του οδικού δικτύου: 10, Οδική απεικόνιση· 20, διάδοση Parkway· 70, διάδοση στο οδικό δίκτυο· 80, Οδική διάδοση στο τούνελ."},{"@language":"en-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Infrastructure consists of the following object and subtypes (for the current list see General Product Specification Base Map): Track network: 10, Metro tracks; 20, SJ Normal track; 30, SJ Narrow track; 60, Tram tracks. Traffic facility: 10, Navfollower; 20, Perrong; 50, Bridge; 60, Tunnel; 80, Terrain staircase. Road demarcation: 10, Entrance; 20, Refug. Road propagation: 10, Road illustration; 20, Parkway propagation; 70, Road propagation; 80, Road propagation in tunnel."},{"@language":"es-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"La infraestructura consta de los siguientes objetos y subtipos (para consultar la lista actual, véase el mapa base de las especificaciones generales del producto): Red de seguimiento: 10, vías de metro; 20, SJ Vía normal; 30, SJ Vía estrecha; 60, huellas del tranvía. Facilidad de tráfico: 10, Navfollower; 20, Perrong; 50, puente; 60, túnel; 80, escalera del terreno. Demarcación de carreteras: 10, entrada; 20 años, Refug. Propagación por carretera: 10, Ilustración del camino; 20, propagación de Parkway; 70, Propagación de carreteras; 80, Propagación de carreteras en túnel."},{"@language":"et-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Taristu koosneb järgmistest objektidest ja alatüüpidest (praeguse loetelu kohta vt üldise tootespetsifikaadi aluskaart): Rööbasteevõrk: 10, metroorajad; 20, SJ Normaalne rada; 30, SJ Kitsas rada; 60, Trammirajad. Liiklusrajatis: 10, Navfollower; 20, Perrong, 50, sild; 60, tunnel; 80, Terrain trepp. Teede piiritlemine: 10, sissepääs; 20, põgenik. Teede paljundamine: 10, tee illustratsioon; 20, Parkway paljundamine; 70, Teede paljundamine; 80, Teede paljundus tunnelis."},{"@language":"fi-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Infrastruktuuri koostuu seuraavista kohteista ja alatyypeistä (nykyisen luettelon osalta katso yleinen tuote-eritelmän peruskartta): Rataverkko: 10, metroradat; 20, SJ Normaali rata; 30, SJ Kapea rata; 60, raitiovaunujen jälkiä. Liikenneväline: 10, Navfollower; 20, Perrong; 50, silta; 60, tunneli; 80, Maastoportaat. Tien rajaus: 10, Sisäänkäynti; 20 pistettä, Refug. Tien eteneminen: 10, Tien kuva; 20, Parkway-lisäys; 70, tien eteneminen; 80, Tien eteneminen tunnelissa."},{"@language":"fr-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"L'infrastructure se compose de l'objet et des sous-types suivants (pour la liste actuelle, voir la carte de base des spécifications générales du produit): Réseau de voies: 10, Voies de métro; 20, voie normale SJ; 30, voie étroite SJ; 60, Tramway. Facilité de circulation: 10, Navfollower; 20, Perrong; 50, pont; 60, tunnel; 80, Escalier de terrain. Démarcation routière: 10, Entrée; 20, Refug. Propagation routière: 10, Illustration routière; 20, propagation de la promenade; 70, Propagation des routes; 80, Propagation de la route dans le tunnel."},{"@language":"ga-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Tá an réad agus na fochineálacha seo a leanas sa bhonneagar (le haghaidh an liosta reatha féach Bunléarscáil Sonraíochta Táirge Ginearálta): Líonra rianta: 10, rianta Metro; 20, SJ Gnáthrian; 30, SJ caolrian; 60, Tram rianta. Saoráid tráchta: 10, Navfollower; 20, Perrong; 50, Droichead; 60, Tollán; 80, Staighre tír-raoin. Críochú bóthair: 10, Iontráil; 20, Refug. Iomadú bóthair: 10, Léaráid bhóthair; 20, Forleathadh Parkway; 70, Iomadú bóthair; 80, Iomadú bóthair i dtollán."},{"@language":"hr-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Infrastruktura se sastoji od sljedećih objekata i podvrsta (za trenutačni popis vidjeti osnovnu kartu opće specifikacije proizvoda): Mreža kolosijeka: 10, tračnice podzemne željeznice; 20, SJ Normal track; 30, SJ Uski kolosijek; 60, Tramvajske staze. Prometni objekt: 10, Navfollower; 20, Perrong; 50, most; 60, tunel; 80, Terrain stubište. Razgraničenje cesta: 10, Ulaz; 20, Odbij. Umnažanje cesta: 10, ilustracija ceste; 20, razmnožavanje Parkwaya; 70, širenje cesta; 80, širenje ceste u tunelu."},{"@language":"hu-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Az infrastruktúra a következő objektumokból és altípusokból áll (az aktuális listát lásd az Általános Termékleírási Alaptérképben): Pályahálózat: 10, metróvágányok; 20, SJ Normál vágány; 30, SJ keskeny nyomtáv; 60, villamos nyomok. Forgalmi létesítmény: 10, Navfollower; 20 éves, Perrong; 50, híd; 60., Alagút; 80, Terep lépcsőház. Közúti elhatárolás: 10, Bejárat; 20 éves, Refug. Útterjedés: 10, közúti illusztráció; 20, Parkway-terjedés; 70, Közúti terjedés; 80, Útterjedés az alagútban."},{"@language":"it-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"L'infrastruttura è costituita dai seguenti oggetti e sottotipi (per l'elenco corrente si veda General Product Specification Base Map): Rete di binari: 10, binari della metropolitana; 20, pista normale di SJ; 30, pista stretta di SJ; 60, binari del tram. Impianto di traffico: 10, Navfollower; 20, Perrong; 50, ponte; 60, galleria; 80, Scala del terreno. Demarcazione stradale: 10, Ingresso; 20, rifiuto. propagazione stradale: 10, illustrazione stradale; 20, propagazione di Parkway; 70, propagazione stradale; 80, propagazione stradale in galleria."},{"@language":"lt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Infrastruktūrą sudaro toliau nurodyti objektai ir potipiai (dabartinį sąrašą žr. Bendrosios produkto specifikacijos baziniame žemėlapyje): Bėgių kelių tinklas: 10, Metro bėgių keliai; 20, SJ įprastas bėgių kelias; 30, SJ siauras kelias; 60, Tramvajų trasos. Eismo infrastruktūra: 10, Navfollower; 20, Perrong; 50, tiltas; 60, tunelis; 80, Terrain laiptai. Kelio atribojimas: 10, įėjimas; 20, Refug. Kelio sklidimas: 10, Kelio iliustracija; 20, Parkway dauginimas; 70, Kelių sklidimas; 80, Kelio sklidimas tuneliu."},{"@language":"lv-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Infrastruktūru veido šādi objekti un apakštipi (pašreizējo sarakstu sk. vispārējā produkta specifikācijas bāzes kartē): Sliežu ceļu tīkls: 10, metro trases; 20, SJ parastā trase; 30, SJ šaura trase; 60, tramvaju trases. Satiksmes iekārta: 10, Navfollower; 20, Perrong; 50, tilts; 60, tunelis; 80, Terrain kāpnes. Ceļu demarkācija: 10, ieeja; 20, atteikums. Ceļu pavairošana: 10, ceļa ilustrācija; 20, Parkway pavairošana; 70, Ceļu pavairošana; 80, Ceļu pavairošanu tunelī."},{"@language":"mt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"L-infrastruttura tikkonsisti mill-oġġett u s-sottotipi li ġejjin (għal-lista attwali ara l-Mappa Bażi tal-Ispeċifikazzjoni Ġenerali tal-Prodott): Network tal-binarji: 10, Trekks tal-metro; 20, SJ Traċċa normali; 30, SJ Narrow track; 60, Trekks tat-tramm. Faċilità tat-traffiku: 10, Navfollower; 20, Perrong; 50, Pont; 60, Mina; 80, Taraġ tal-art. Id-demarkazzjoni tat-toroq: 10, Dħul; 20, Refug. Propagazzjoni tat-triq: 10, Illustrazzjoni tat-triq; 20, Propagazzjoni tal-parkway; 70, Propagazzjoni tat-triq; 80, Propagazzjoni tat-triq fil-mina."},{"@language":"nl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Infrastructuur bestaat uit de volgende objecten en subtypen (zie voor de huidige lijst de basiskaart van het algemene productdossier): Spoornetwerk: 10, Metrosporen; 20, SJ Normaal spoor; 30, SJ smal spoor; 60, Tramsporen. Verkeersvoorziening: 10, Navfollower; 20, Perrong; 50, Brug; 60, Tunnel; 80, Terreintrap. Wegafbakening: 10, Ingang; 20, toevluchtsoord. Wegverspreiding: 10, Wegillustratie; 20, Parkway-voortplanting; 70, Wegverspreiding; 80, Wegverspreiding in tunnel."},{"@language":"pl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Infrastruktura składa się z następujących obiektów i podtypów (aktualna lista znajduje się w mapie podstawowej specyfikacji produktu): Sieć torowa: 10, tory metra; 20, SJ Normalny tor; 30, wąski tor SJ; 60, tory tramwajowe. Infrastruktura ruchu drogowego: 10, Navfollower; 20, Perrong; 50, mostek; 60, tunel; 80, schody terenowe. Wyznaczenie drogi: 10, wejście; 20, schronienie. Rozprzestrzenianie się na drogach: 10, ilustracja drogowa; 20, Rozprzestrzenianie się drogi parkowej; 70, Rozprzestrzenianie się dróg; 80, Propagacja drogowa w tunelu."},{"@language":"pt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"A infraestrutura consiste no seguinte objeto e subtipos (para a lista atual, ver mapa de base das especificações gerais do produto): Rede de vias: 10, vias de metropolitano; 20, SJ Via normal; 30, SJ Via estreita; 60, rastos de eléctrico. Instalação de tráfego: 10, Navfollower; 20, Perrong; 50, Ponte; 60, túnel; 80, Escada do terreno. Demarcação rodoviária: 10, Entrada; 20, Refug. Propagação rodoviária: 10, Ilustração rodoviária; 20, Propagação de pistas de estacionamento; 70, Propagação rodoviária; 80, Propagação da estrada no túnel."},{"@language":"ro-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Infrastructura constă în următoarele obiecte și subtipuri (pentru lista actuală, a se vedea Harta de bază a caietului de sarcini general al produsului): Rețeaua de cale ferată: 10, piste de metrou; 20, SJ pistă normală; 30, SJ Linie îngustă; 60, șine de tramvai. Instalație de trafic: 10, Navfollower; 20, Perrong; 50, Podul; 60, tunelul; 80, scară de teren. Delimitarea drumurilor: 10, Intrarea; 20, în refugiu. Propagarea drumurilor: 10, Ilustrație rutieră; 20, propagarea pe Parkway; 70, Propagarea drumurilor; 80, Propagarea drumului în tunel."},{"@language":"sk-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Infraštruktúra pozostáva z týchto objektov a podtypov (pre aktuálny zoznam pozri základnú mapu všeobecných špecifikácií výrobku): Koľajová sieť: 10, Metro koľaje; 20, normálna dráha SJ; 30, SJ Úzka trať; 60, električkové trate. Dopravné zariadenie: 10, Navfollower; 20, Perrong; 50, most; 60, tunel; 80, prízemné schodisko. Vymedzenie cesty: 10, vstupné; 20, refugovať. Šírenie ciest: 10, Cestná ilustrácia; 20, propagácia parkway; 70, Šírenie ciest; 80, Šírenie cesty v tuneli."},{"@language":"sl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Infrastrukturo sestavljajo naslednji objekti in podtipi (za trenutni seznam glej osnovni zemljevid splošnih specifikacij proizvoda): Tirno omrežje: 10, podzemne železnice; 20, SJ običajna proga; 30, SJ ozka proga; 60, tramvajske steze. Prometni objekt: 10, Navfollower; 20, Perrong; 50, most; 60, predor; 80, terensko stopnišče. Razmejitev cest: 10, vhod; 20, refug. št. Razmnoževanje v cestnem prometu: 10, Ilustracija ceste; 20, širjenje Parkwaya; 70, širjenje cest; 80, širjenje ceste v tunelu."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Infrastruktur består av följande objekt- och subtyper (för aktuell lista se Allmän produktspecifikation Baskartan): Spårnät: 10, Tunnelbanespår; 20, SJ Normalspår; 30, SJ Smalspår; 60, Spårvagnsspår. Trafikanläggning: 10, Navföljare; 20, Perrong; 50, Bro; 60, Tunnel; 80, Terrängtrappa. Vägavgränsning: 10, Infart; 20, Refug. Vägutbredning: 10, Vägillustration; 20, Parkvägsutbredning; 70, Vägutbredning; 80, Vägutbredning i tunnel."},{"@language":"uk-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Інфраструктура складається з наступних об'єктів і підтипів (для поточного списку див. Відстеження мережі: 10, Метро колії; 20, SJ Нормальна доріжка; 30, SJ Вузька колія; 60, Трамвайні колії. Об'єкт дорожнього руху: 10, Navfollower; 20, Перронг; 50, міст; 60, тунель; 80, сходова клітка. Демаркація доріг: 10) вхід; Двадцять, відступ. Розповсюдження доріг: 10, Дорожня ілюстрація; 20, розмноження Парквей; 70, Розповсюдження доріг; 80, Розповсюдження доріг у тунелі."}],"dct:format":"text/html","dct:identifier":"6724fc99-fd4b-4418-bd23-b42e1be55a32","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"1992-01-01"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"https://dataportal.se/concepts/licensecategories/otherlicense"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-10-27"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2120000142"},"dct:spatial":{"@id":"_:6413d0c5cbab6b4c03d1e220ea1d8ea3012a17e771544fe1649534c388f637ea_b0n0"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"bg-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"SBK Базова карта - Инфраструктура"},{"@language":"cs-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"SBK Základní mapa - Infrastruktura"},{"@language":"da-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"SBK Basiskort - Infrastruktur"},{"@language":"de-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"SBK Basiskarte - Infrastruktur"},{"@lan