στο προϊόν Χάρτης πόλης Στοκχόλμη Κομητεία"},{"@language":"en-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"The data set is included in the product City map Stockholm County"},{"@language":"es-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"El conjunto de datos se incluye en el mapa de la ciudad del producto Stockholm County"},{"@language":"et-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Andmekogum sisaldub tootes City map Stockholm County"},{"@language":"fi-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Aineisto sisältyy tuotteeseen Kaupunkikartta Tukholman lääni"},{"@language":"fr-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"L'ensemble de données est inclus dans le produit Carte de ville Comté de Stockholm"},{"@language":"ga-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Tá an tacar sonraí san áireamh sa táirge Léarscáil na Cathrach Contae Stócólm"},{"@language":"hr-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Skup podataka uključen je u proizvod Karta grada Stockholmska županija"},{"@language":"hu-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Az adatkészlet a termékben található Várostérkép Stockholm megye"},{"@language":"it-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Il set di dati è incluso nel prodotto City map Stockholm County"},{"@language":"lt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Duomenų rinkinys yra įtrauktas į produkto Miesto žemėlapis Stockholm County"},{"@language":"lv-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Datu kopa ir iekļauta produkta pilsētas kartē Stockholm County"},{"@language":"mt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Is-sett ta’ data huwa inkluż fil-mappa tal-prodott tal-Belt tal-Kontea ta’ Stokkolma"},{"@language":"nl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"De dataset is opgenomen in het product Stadskaart Stockholm County"},{"@language":"pl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Zbiór danych znajduje się w produkcie Mapa miasta Stockholm County"},{"@language":"pt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"O conjunto de dados está incluído no produto Mapa da cidade Condado de Estocolmo"},{"@language":"ro-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Setul de date este inclus în produsul Harta orașului Stockholm County"},{"@language":"sk-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Súbor údajov je súčasťou produktu Mapa mesta Štokholmská župa"},{"@language":"sl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Nabor podatkov je vključen v izdelek Zemljevid mesta Stockholm County"},{"@language":"uk-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Набір даних включений в продукт Карта міста Стокгольмського повіту"}],"foaf:primaryTopic":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/88u/distribution/9664b288-87db-45ad-a834-195d00cb681b"}},{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/88u/record/8d0c4088-57a1-40a3-91cf-030b7cbc43b0","@type":"dcat:CatalogRecord","dcat:distribution":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/88u/distribution/9664b288-87db-45ad-a834-195d00cb681b"},"dct:creator":{"@id":"http://piveau.io"},"dct:identifier":"8d0c4088-57a1-40a3-91cf-030b7cbc43b0","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2025-03-06T09:38:17Z"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-07-03T08:41:25Z"},"foaf:primaryTopic":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/88u/dataset/8d0c4088-57a1-40a3-91cf-030b7cbc43b0"},"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksum":{"@id":"_:80517a24e0ec8748cef8e388c0fe0e969964f4c01ae8e7a81e449a962c36fa90_b1n0"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/dqv#hasQualityMetadata":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/88u/metrics/8d0c4088-57a1-40a3-91cf-030b7cbc43b0"},"https://europeandataportal.eu/voc#originalLanguage":"sv","https://europeandataportal.eu/voc#transIssued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-06-07T11:15:02Z"},"https://europeandataportal.eu/voc#transReceived":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-07-03T08:41:25Z"},"https://europeandataportal.eu/voc#transStatus":{"@id":"https://europeandataportal.eu/voc#TransCompleted"}},{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2120000142","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:identifier":"2120000142","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/LocalAuthority"},"foaf:mbox":{"@id":"mailto:kommunstyrelsen@stockholm.se"},"foaf:name":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Stockholms stad"},"foaf:page":{"@id":"https://www.stockholm.se"},"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#sameAs":{"@id":"https://resources.stockholm.se/metadata#foaf/Stockholms+stad/"}},{"@id":"https://resources.stockholm.se/metadata#vcard/Stadsbyggnadskontoret+-+Stadsm%C3%A4tningsavdelningen+-+Geodatadistributionsenheten/","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Organization","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Stadsbyggnadskontoret - Stadsmätningsavdelningen - Geodatadistributionsenheten"},"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:geodataservice@stockholm.se"}}],"@id":"urn:source:80517a24e0ec8748cef8e388c0fe0e969964f4c01ae8e7a81e449a962c36fa90"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2021005448","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:identifier":"2021005448","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/NationalAuthority"},"foaf:homepage":{"@id":"https://skatteverket.se"},"foaf:mbox":{"@id":"mailto:robin.mangs@skatteverket.se"},"foaf:name":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Skatteverket"},"foaf:page":{"@id":"https://www.skatteverket.se"},"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#sameAs":[{"@id":"https://skatteverket.entryscape.net/store/29/resource/1"},{"@id":"https://skatteverket.se"}]},{"@id":"https://www7.skatteverket.se/portal/apier-och-oppna-data/utvecklarportalen/api/fastighetstaxering-agarforandringar/2.4.0/%2523dataset","@type":["dcat:Dataset","http://entryscape.com/terms/ServedByDataService"],"dcat:distribution":{"@id":"https://www7.skatteverket.se/portal/apier-och-oppna-data/utvecklarportalen/api/fastighetstaxering-agarforandringar/2.4.0/%2523distribution"},"dcat:keyword":{"@language":"sv","@value":"deklaration"},"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/ECON"},"dcat:version":"2.4","dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/RESTRICTED"},"dct:description":{"@language":"sv","@value":"API:et Fastighetstaxering - ägarförändringar gör det möjligt för myndigheter att hämta uppgifter om fastigheters ägarförändringar direkt i den egna programvaran. API:et finns tillgängligt som komplett testtjänst och driftsatt tjänst."},"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-06-15"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2021005448"},"dct:title":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Fastighetstaxering - ägarförändringar"},"http://entryscape.com/terms/servedByDataService":{"@id":"https://www7.skatteverket.se/portal-wapi/open/apier-och-oppna-data/utvecklarportalen/v1/oas-for-api/fastighetstaxering-agarforandringar/2.4.0/swagger.json%2523accessService"}},{"@id":"https://www7.skatteverket.se/portal/apier-och-oppna-data/utvecklarportalen/api/fastighetstaxering-agarforandringar/2.4.0/%2523distribution","@type":["dcat:Distribution","http://entryscape.com/terms/ServiceDistribution"],"dcat:accessService":{"@id":"https://www7.skatteverket.se/portal-wapi/open/apier-och-oppna-data/utvecklarportalen/v1/oas-for-api/fastighetstaxering-agarforandringar/2.4.0/swagger.json%2523accessService"},"dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://www7.skatteverket.se/portal/apier-och-oppna-data/utvecklarportalen/api/fastighetstaxering-agarforandringar/2.4.0/%C3%96versikt"},"dct:conformsTo":{"@id":"https://www7.skatteverket.se/portal-wapi/open/apier-och-oppna-data/utvecklarportalen/v1/oas-for-api/fastighetstaxering-agarforandringar/2.4.0/swagger.json"},"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/JSON"},"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-06-15"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:title":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Fastighetstaxering - ägarförändringar"}}],"@id":"urn:source:80730394f0c201b6d92ca39da46cae04b5e131781721efcc9b62003641b0f473"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2021005448","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:identifier":"2021005448","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/NationalAuthority"},"foaf:homepage":{"@id":"https://skatteverket.se"},"foaf:mbox":{"@id":"mailto:robin.mangs@skatteverket.se"},"foaf:name":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Skatteverket"},"foaf:page":{"@id":"https://www.skatteverket.se"},"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#sameAs":[{"@id":"https://skatteverket.entryscape.net/store/29/resource/1"},{"@id":"https://skatteverket.se"}]},{"@id":"https://www7.skatteverket.se/portal/apier-och-oppna-data/utvecklarportalen/api/inkomstdeklaration2-4/1.0.3/%2523dataset","@type":["dcat:Dataset","http://entryscape.com/terms/ServedByDataService"],"dcat:distribution":{"@id":"https://www7.skatteverket.se/portal/apier-och-oppna-data/utvecklarportalen/api/inkomstdeklaration2-4/1.0.3/%2523distribution"},"dcat:keyword":[{"@language":"sv","@value":" redovisning"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"deklaration"}],"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/ECON"},"dcat:version":"1.0","dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/RESTRICTED"},"dct:description":{"@language":"sv","@value":"API:et kan användas för företag som lämnar Inkomstdeklaration 2, 3 och 4. Med API Inkomstdeklaration 2-4 kan du bland annat hämta och visa upp förifyllda deklarationsuppgifter direkt i programvaran."},"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-05-26"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2021005448"},"dct:title":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Inkomstdeklaration 2-4"},"http://entryscape.com/terms/servedByDataService":{"@id":"https://www7.skatteverket.se/portal-wapi/open/apier-och-oppna-data/utvecklarportalen/v1/oas-for-api/inkomstdeklaration2-4/1.0.3/swagger.json%2523accessService"}},{"@id":"https://www7.skatteverket.se/portal/apier-och-oppna-data/utvecklarportalen/api/inkomstdeklaration2-4/1.0.3/%2523distribution","@type":["dcat:Distribution","http://entryscape.com/terms/ServiceDistribution"],"dcat:accessService":{"@id":"https://www7.skatteverket.se/portal-wapi/open/apier-och-oppna-data/utvecklarportalen/v1/oas-for-api/inkomstdeklaration2-4/1.0.3/swagger.json%2523accessService"},"dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://www7.skatteverket.se/portal/apier-och-oppna-data/utvecklarportalen/api/inkomstdeklaration2-4/1.0.3/%C3%96versikt"},"dct:conformsTo":{"@id":"https://www7.skatteverket.se/portal-wapi/open/apier-och-oppna-data/utvecklarportalen/v1/oas-for-api/inkomstdeklaration2-4/1.0.3/swagger.json"},"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/JSON"},"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-05-26"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:title":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Inkomstdeklaration 2-4"}}],"@id":"urn:source:808e7a9693aa9b2e8ed8d9be84a75af6c801b8dbf47c57eab22f995905d7a98c"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:817ab4a47a72d0c4df7253e4fc354408796f80c371bc36163dd9ab92611f8b44_b0n0","@type":"http://schema.org/Offer","http://schema.org/description":{"@language":"sv","@value":"För extern leverans utgår en kostnad baserad på vår taxa."},"http://schema.org/mainEntityOfPage":{"@id":"https://www.huddinge.se/bostad-och-miljo/kartor-och-lantmateri/kartor-och-mattjanster/"}},{"@id":"_:817ab4a47a72d0c4df7253e4fc354408796f80c371bc36163dd9ab92611f8b44_b1n0","@type":"http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Attribution","dcat:hadRole":{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/ResponsiblePartyRole/owner"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#agent":{"@id":"https://metadatakatalog.huddinge.se/store/26/resource/1"}},{"@id":"_:817ab4a47a72d0c4df7253e4fc354408796f80c371bc36163dd9ab92611f8b44_b2n0","@type":"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#Checksum","http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#algorithm":{"@id":"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksumAlgorithm_md5"},"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksumValue":"113daaaaec6b0751afab4c338e3321c8f9"},{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/88u/dataset/laserdata","@type":"dcat:Dataset","dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://metadatakatalog.huddinge.se/store/5/resource/6"},"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/RESTRICTED"},"dct:conformsTo":{"@id":"http://www.opengis.net/def/crs/EPSG/0/3011"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"bg-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Сурови данни за информация за надморската височина под формата на точкови облаци от въздушно лазерно сканиране. \nДата на полета: 230422-230507\nПлътност на пунктуацията: 16 pkt/sqm\nТочност във височина: 5 см\nРазработена е и 1 м координатна мрежа за поземлен, строителен и строителен модел."},{"@language":"cs-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Surová data pro informace o nadmořské výšce ve formě bodových oblaků z leteckého laserového skenování. \nDatum letu: 230422-230507\nHustota interpunkce: 16 pkt/m2\nPřesnost ve výšce: 5 cm\nRozvíjí se také 1m mřížka pro model pozemního, stavebního a inženýrského stavitelství."},{"@language":"da-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Rå data for højdeoplysninger i form af punktskyer fra luftbåren laserscanning. \nFlyvningsdato: 230422-230507\nTegnsætningstæthed: 16 pkt./kvadratmeter\nNøjagtighed i højden: 5 cm\n1m gitter til jord, byggeri og anlægsarbejder model er også udviklet."},{"@language":"de-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Rohdaten zur Höheninformation in Form von Punktwolken aus dem luftgestützten Laserscanning. \nFlugdatum: 230422-230507\nSatzdichte: 16 pkt/qm\nGenauigkeit in der Höhe: 5 cm\n1m Raster für Land-, Hoch- und Tiefbaumodell wird ebenfalls entwickelt."},{"@language":"el-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Ακατέργαστα δεδομένα για πληροφορίες υψομέτρου με τη μορφή σημειακών νεφών από αερομεταφερόμενη σάρωση με λέιζερ. \nΗμερομηνία πτήσης: 230422-230507\nΠυκνότητα στίξης: 16 pkt/sqm\nΑκρίβεια ύψους: 5 cm\nΑναπτύσσεται επίσης ένα δίκτυο 1m για τη γη, τα κτίρια και το μοντέλο πολιτικού μηχανικού."},{"@language":"en-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Raw data for altitude information in the form of point clouds from airborne laser scanning. \nDate of flight: 230422-230507\nPunctuation density: 16 pkt/sqm\nAccuracy in height: 5 cm\n1m grid for land, building and civil engineering model is also developed."},{"@language":"es-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Datos brutos para la información de altitud en forma de nubes de puntos del escaneo láser aerotransportado. \nFecha de vuelo: 230422-230507\nDensidad de puntuacion: 16 pkt/sqm\nPrecisión en altura: 5 cm\nTambién se desarrolla una cuadrícula de 1 m para el terreno, la construcción y el modelo de ingeniería civil."},{"@language":"et-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Raw andmed kõrgust teavet kujul punkt pilved õhus laser skaneerimine. \nLennu kuupäev: 230422-230507\nTäpsustihedus: 16 pkt/m2\nKõrguse täpsus: 5 cm\nSamuti on välja töötatud 1 m võrk maa-, ehitus- ja tsiviilehitusmudeli jaoks."},{"@language":"fi-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Raakatiedot korkeustiedoista pistepilvien muodossa ilmassa olevasta laserkeilauksesta. \nLennon päivämäärä: 230422-230507\nVälimerkkitiheys: 16 kpl/neliömetri\nKorkeustarkkuus: 5 cm\nKehitetään myös 1 metrin verkko maa-, rakennus- ja maa- ja vesirakennusmallia varten."},{"@language":"fr-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Données brutes pour les informations d'altitude sous la forme de nuages de points provenant du balayage laser aéroporté. \nDate du vol: 230422-230507\nDensité de ponctuation: 16 pkt/m2\nPrécision en hauteur: 5 cm\nUn réseau de 1 m pour le modèle de terrain, de bâtiment et de génie civil est également développé."},{"@language":"ga-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Sonraí amha le haghaidh faisnéis airde i bhfoirm scamaill phointe ó scanadh léasair aerbheirthe. \nDáta na heitilte: 230422-230507\nDlús poncaíochta: 16 pkt/sqm\nCruinneas san airde: 5 cm\nForbraítear greille 1m le haghaidh samhail talún, tógála agus innealtóireachta sibhialta freisin."},{"@language":"hr-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Sirovi podaci za informacije o nadmorskoj visini u obliku točkastih oblaka iz laserskog skeniranja u zraku. \nDatum leta: 230422-230507\nGustoća interpunkcije: 16 pkt/m2\nTočnost u visini: 5 cm\nRazvijena je i mreža od 1 m za model zemljišta, građevinarstva i niskogradnje."},{"@language":"hu-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Nyers adatok a magassági információkhoz pontfelhők formájában a levegőben végzett lézeres szkennelésből. \nRepülés dátuma: 230422-230507\nPontozási sűrűség: 16 pkt/m2\nPontosság magasságban: 5 cm\n1 m-es föld-, épület- és mélyépítési hálózatot is kidolgoztak."},{"@language":"it-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Dati grezzi per le informazioni sull'altitudine sotto forma di nuvole di punti dalla scansione laser aerea. \nData del volo: 230422-230507\nDensità di punteggiatura: 16 pkt/mq\nPrecisione in altezza: 5 cm\nViene inoltre sviluppata una griglia da 1 m per il modello di terra, edilizia e ingegneria civile."},{"@language":"lt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Neapdoroti aukščio informacijos duomenys, t. y. taškiniai debesys, gauti nuskenavus ore sklindantį lazerį. \nSkrydžio data: 230422-230507\nskyrybos tankis: 16 pkt/m2\nTikslumas aukštyje: 5 cm\nTaip pat sukurtas 1 m tinklelis žemės, pastatų ir civilinės inžinerijos modeliui."},{"@language":"lv-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Neapstrādāti dati informācijai par augstumu punktveida mākoņu veidā no lāzerskenēšanas gaisā. \nLidojuma datums: 230422-230507\nPieturzīmju blīvums: 16 pkt/kv.m.\nAugstuma precizitāte: 5 cm\nIzstrādāts arī 1m režģis zemes, ēku un inženierbūvju modelim."},{"@language":"mt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Data mhux ipproċessata għall-informazzjoni dwar l-altitudni fil-forma ta’ sħab fil-punt minn skennjar bil-laser fl-ajru. \nData tat-titjira: 230422-230507\nDensità tal-punteġġjatura: 16 pkt/sqm\nPreċiżjoni fl-għoli: 5 cm\nĠiet żviluppata wkoll grilja ta’ 1m għall-mudell tal-art, tal-bini u tal-inġinerija ċivili."},{"@language":"nl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Ruwe gegevens voor hoogte-informatie in de vorm van puntwolken van laserscanning in de lucht. \nDatum van de vlucht: 230422-230507\nPunctuatiedichtheid: 16 pkt/m2\nNauwkeurigheid in hoogte: 5 cm\n1m net voor land, bouw en civiele techniek model is ook ontwikkeld."},{"@language":"pl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Surowe dane dla informacji o wysokości w postaci chmur punktów z lotniczego skanowania laserowego. \nData lotu: 230422-230507\nGęstość interpunkcyjna: 16 pkt/m2\nDokładność wysokości: 5 cm\nOpracowano również 1-metrową siatkę dla modelu gruntów, budynków i inżynierii lądowej."},{"@language":"pt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Dados brutos para informações de altitude na forma de nuvens pontuais de varredura a laser no ar. \nData do voo: 230422-230507\nDensidade de pontuação: 16 pkt/m2\nPrecisão em altura: 5 cm\nTambém é desenvolvida uma grelha de 1 m para o modelo de terrenos, edifícios e engenharia civil."},{"@language":"ro-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Date brute pentru informațiile privind altitudinea sub formă de nori punctuali de la scanarea cu laser în aer. \nData zborului: 230422-230507\nDensitatea de punctuație: 16 pkt/mp\nPrecizie în înălțime: 5 cm\nEste dezvoltată, de asemenea, o rețea de 1 m pentru modelul de teren, clădiri și inginerie civilă."},{"@language":"sk-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Nespracované údaje pre informácie o nadmorskej výške vo forme bodových oblakov z leteckého laserového skenovania. \nDátum letu: 230422-230507\nHustota prerušovania: 16 pkt/m2\nPresnosť vo výške: 5 cm\nVyvinutá je aj mriežka pre pozemný, stavebný a stavebno-inžiniersky model."},{"@language":"sl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Neobdelani podatki za informacije o nadmorski višini v obliki oblakov točk iz laserskega skeniranja v zraku. \nDatum leta: 230422-230507\nGostota ločil: 16 kt/m2\nNatančnost v višini: 5 cm\nRazvito je tudi 1 m omrežje za model zemljišč, stavb in nizkih gradenj."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Rådata för höjdinformation i form av punktmoln från flygburen laserskanning. \nFlygdatum: 230422-230507\nPunkttäthet: 16 pkt/kvm\nNoggrannhet i höjd: 5 cm\n1m-grid för mark-, byggnads- och anläggningsmodell finns också framtaget."},{"@language":"uk-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Сирі дані для інформації про висоту у вигляді точкових хмар від повітряного лазерного сканування. \nДата польоту: 230422-230507\nЩільність пунктуації: 16 pkt/sqm\nТочність по висоті: 5 см\nТакож розроблена 1м сітка для моделі землі, будівництва та цивільного будівництва."}],"dct:identifier":"laserdata","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:gYear","@value":"2023"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"https://dataportal.se/concepts/licensecategories/nolicense"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2120000068"},"dct:subject":{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/TopicCategory/elevation"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"bg-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Лазерни данни"},{"@language":"cs-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Laserová data"},{"@language":"da-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Laserdata"},{"@language":"de-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Laserdaten"},{"@language":"el-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Δεδομένα λέιζερ"},{"@language":"en-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Laser data"},{"@language":"es-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Datos del láser"},{"@language":"et-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Laserandmed"},{"@language":"fi-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Laserdata"},{"@language":"fr-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Données laser"},{"@language":"ga-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Sonraí léasair"},{"@language":"hr-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Laserski podaci"},{"@language":"hu-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Lézeradatok"},{"@language":"it-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Dati laser"},{"@language":"lt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Lazerio duomenys"},{"@language":"lv-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Lāzera dati"},{"@language":"mt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Data tal-laser"},{"@language":"nl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Lasergegevens"},{"@language":"pl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Dane laserowe"},{"@language":"pt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Dados a laser"},{"@language":"ro-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Date cu laser"},{"@language":"sk-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Laserové dáta"},{"@language":"sl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Laserski podatki"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Laserdata"},{"@language":"uk-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Лазерні дані"}],"http://schema.org/offers":{"@id":"_:817ab4a47a72d0c4df7253e4fc354408796f80c371bc36163dd9ab92611f8b44_b0n0"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#qualifiedAttribution":{"@id":"_:817ab4a47a72d0c4df7253e4fc354408796f80c371bc36163dd9ab92611f8b44_b1n0"}},{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/88u/record/laserdata","@type":"dcat:CatalogRecord","dct:creator":{"@id":"http://piveau.io"},"dct:identifier":"laserdata","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2025-03-06T09:38:36Z"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-07-03T08:41:11Z"},"foaf:primaryTopic":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/88u/dataset/laserdata"},"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksum":{"@id":"_:817ab4a47a72d0c4df7253e4fc354408796f80c371bc36163dd9ab92611f8b44_b2n0"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/dqv#hasQualityMetadata":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/88u/metrics/laserdata"},"https://europeandataportal.eu/voc#originalLanguage":"sv","https://europeandataportal.eu/voc#transIssued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-06-07T11:15:02Z"},"https://europeandataportal.eu/voc#transReceived":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-07-03T08:41:11Z"},"https://europeandataportal.eu/voc#transStatus":{"@id":"https://europeandataportal.eu/voc#TransCompleted"}},{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2120000068","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:identifier":"2120000068","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/LocalAuthority"},"foaf:mbox":{"@id":"mailto:gis-support@huddinge.se"},"foaf:name":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Huddinge kommun"},"foaf:page":{"@id":"https://www.huddinge.se"}},{"@id":"https://metadatakatalog.huddinge.se/store/26/resource/1","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/LocalAuthority"},"foaf:name":"MBF Lantmäteriavdelningen MoK"},{"@id":"https://metadatakatalog.huddinge.se/store/5/resource/6","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Organization","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"MBF Lantmäteriavdelningen","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:lantmateri@huddinge.se"}}],"@id":"urn:source:817ab4a47a72d0c4df7253e4fc354408796f80c371bc36163dd9ab92611f8b44"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:82dc2fb324860150e1eb23df3c8acb713514320d8ab7d525f271bee4d8df3fb9_b0n0","@type":"dct:Location","dcat:bbox":{"@type":"http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral","@value":"POLYGON((17.7605 59.4402,18.2011 59.4402,18.2011 59.2272,17.7605 59.2272,17.7605 59.4402))"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/locn#geometry":{"@type":"http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral","@value":"POLYGON((17.7605 59.4402,18.2011 59.4402,18.2011 59.2272,17.7605 59.2272,17.7605 59.4402))"}},{"@id":"_:82dc2fb324860150e1eb23df3c8acb713514320d8ab7d525f271bee4d8df3fb9_b1n0","@type":"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#Checksum","http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#algorithm":{"@id":"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksumAlgorithm_md5"},"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksumValue":"11cf3d505585b3deb6009dbf08c9607a7c"},{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/88u/dataset/208b981b-84d8-4a76-b140-ab47673ff4c0","@type":["dcat:Dataset","dcat:dataset"],"dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://resources.stockholm.se/metadata#vcard/Stadsbyggnadskontoret+-+Stadsm%C3%A4tningsavdelningen+-+Geodatadistributionsenheten/"},"dcat:distribution":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/88u/distribution/2732bd2c-0bd3-428e-8a11-e78f17574024"},"dcat:keyword":[{"@language":"sv","@value":"Extern dataportal"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Fullständiga metadata"}],"dcat:landingPage":{"@id":"https://dataportalen.stockholm.se/dataportalen/GetMetaDataById?id=82b9f3aa-6c8c-4ef0-8d7a-590e02332ca0"},"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/TECH"},"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/RESTRICTED"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/CONT"},"dct:created":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"1999-01-01"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"bg-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Карта на града - Адрес, град, улица се състои от следните подтипове (подтипове) при информационната класификация за 2020 г. (за текущия списък вж. Обща продуктова спецификация Карта на града): Адрес местоположение10, Адрес местоположение, модифицирано, активно местоположение на адреса не FIR10, Адрес местоположение, което не е FIR, модифицирано, активно име на улицата10, име на улицата, модифицирано, активно"},{"@language":"cs-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Mapa města - Adresa, město, ulice sestávala z následujících podtypů (podtypů) v klasifikaci informací 2020 (aktuální seznam viz Obecná specifikace produktu Mapa města): Umístění adresy10, Umístění adresy, upravitelné, activeAddress location not FIR10, Umístění adresy není FIR, upravitelné, active Název ulice10, Název ulice, upravitelné, active"},{"@language":"da-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Bykort - Adresse, by, gade bestod af følgende undertyper (undertyper) i informationsklassifikationen 2020 (for den aktuelle liste se Generel produktspecifikation Bykort): Adresseplacering10, Adresseplacering, modificerbar, aktivAdresseplacering ikke FIR10, Adresseplacering ikke FIR, modificerbar, aktiv Gadenavn10, Gadenavn, modificerbar, aktiv"},{"@language":"de-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Stadtplan - Adresse, Stadt, Straße bestand aus den folgenden Untertypen (Untertypen) bei der Informationsklassifizierung 2020 (für die aktuelle Liste siehe Allgemeine Produktspezifikation Stadtplan): Adresse location10, Adresse location, modifizierbar, activeAdresse location not FIR10, Adresse location not FIR, modifizierbar, active Straße name10, Straße name, modifizierbar, active"},{"@language":"el-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Χάρτης πόλης - Διεύθυνση, πόλη, οδός αποτελούνταν από τους ακόλουθους υποτύπους (υποτύπους) στην ταξινόμηση πληροφοριών 2020 (για τον τρέχοντα κατάλογο βλέπε γενικές προδιαγραφές προϊόντος Χάρτης πόλης): Διεύθυνση τοποθεσία10, Διεύθυνση τοποθεσία, τροποποιήσιμη, ενεργήΔιεύθυνση τοποθεσία δεν FIR10, Διεύθυνση τοποθεσία δεν FIR, τροποποιήσιμη, ενεργή Οδός όνομα10, Οδός όνομα, τροποποιήσιμη, ενεργή"},{"@language":"en-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"City map - Address, city, street consisted of the following subtypes (subtypes) at the information classification 2020 (for the current list see General product specification City map): Address location10, Address location, modifiable, activeAddress location not FIR10, Address location not FIR, modifiable, active Street name10, Street name, modifiable, active"},{"@language":"es-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Mapa de la ciudad - Dirección, ciudad, calle constaba de los siguientes subtipos (subtipos) en la clasificación de información 2020 (para la lista actual, véase la especificación general del producto Mapa de la ciudad): Dirección ubicación10, Dirección ubicación, modificable, activaDirección ubicación no FIR10, Dirección ubicación no FIR, modificable, activo Nombre de la calle10, Calle nombre, modificable, activo"},{"@language":"et-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Linnakaart - Aadress, linn, tänav koosnes 2020. aasta teabeklassifikatsioonis järgmistest alatüüpidest (alatüübid) (praeguse loetelu kohta vt üldise tootespetsifikaadi linnakaart): Aadressi asukoht10, Aadressi asukoht, muudetav, aktiivneAadressi asukoht ei ole FIR10, Aadressi asukoht ei ole FIR, muudetav, aktiivne Tänava nimi10, Tänava nimi, muudetav, aktiivne"},{"@language":"fi-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Kaupungin kartta - Osoite, kaupunki, katu koostui seuraavista alatyypeistä (alatyypit) tietoluokituksessa 2020 (nykyisestä luettelosta katso Yleiset tuote-eritelmät Kaupungin kartta): Osoitepaikka10, Osoitepaikka, muokattavissa, aktiivinenOsoitepaikka ei FIR10, Osoitepaikka ei FIR, muokattavissa, aktiivinen Kadun nimi10, Kadun nimi, muokattavissa, aktiivinen"},{"@language":"fr-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Carte de la ville - Adresse, ville, rue se composait des sous-types suivants (sous-types) à la classification d'information 2020 (pour la liste actuelle voir Spécification générale du produit Carte de la ville): Adresse localisation10, Adresse localisation, modifiable, activeAdresse localisation not FIR10, Adresse localisation not FIR, modifiable, active Nom de la rue10, Nom de la rue, modifiable, actif"},{"@language":"ga-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Léarscáil chathrach - Is éard a bhí i seoladh, cathair, sráid na fochineálacha (fochineálacha) seo a leanas ag aicmiú faisnéise 2020 (le haghaidh an liosta reatha féach Sonraíocht táirge Ghinearálta Léarscáil chathrach): Seoladh suíomh10, Suíomh seolta, inmhodhnaithe, gníomhachSuíomh seolta seachas FIR10, Suíomh seolta seachas FIR, inmhodhnaithe, gníomhach Ainm sráide10, Ainm sráide, inmhodhnaithe, gníomhach"},{"@language":"hr-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Karta grada - Adresa, grad, ulica sastojala se od sljedećih podvrsta (podvrsta) u informacijskoj klasifikaciji 2020. (za trenutačni popis vidjeti opću specifikaciju proizvoda karta grada): lokacija adrese10, lokacija adrese, promjenjiva, aktivna lokacija adrese nije FIR10, lokacija adrese nije FIR, promjenjiva, aktivni naziv ulice10, naziv ulice, promjenjiva, aktivna"},{"@language":"hu-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Várostérkép - Cím, város, utca a következő altípusokból (altípusokból) állt a 2020-as információs osztályozáskor (az aktuális listát lásd Általános termékleírás Várostérkép): Címhely10, Címhely, módosítható, aktívCímhely nem FIR10, Címhely nem FIR, módosítható, aktív Utcanév10, Utcanév, módosítható, aktív"},{"@language":"it-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Mappa della città - Indirizzo, città, strada consisteva dei seguenti sottotipi (sottotipi) alla classificazione delle informazioni 2020 (per l'elenco corrente vedere Specifiche generali del prodotto Mappa della città): Indirizzo location10, Indirizzo location, modificabile, attivoIndirizzo location not FIR10, Indirizzo location not FIR, modificabile, attivo Nome della strada10, Nome della strada, modificabile, attivo"},{"@language":"lt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Miesto žemėlapis - Adresas, miestas, gatvė 2020 m. informacijos klasifikacijoje sudarė šiuos potipius (potipius) (dabartinį sąrašą žr. Bendrojoje produkto specifikacijoje Miesto žemėlapis): Adreso vieta10, Adreso vieta, modifikuojama, aktyviAdreso vieta ne FIR10, Adreso vieta ne FIR, modifikuojama, aktyvus Gatvės pavadinimas10, Gatvės pavadinimas, modifikuojama, aktyvi"},{"@language":"lv-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Pilsētas karte - Adrese, pilsēta, iela sastāvēja no šādiem apakštipiem (apakštipiem) informācijas klasifikācijā 2020 (pašreizējo sarakstu skatīt vispārējā produkta specifikācijā Pilsētas karte): Adreses atrašanās vieta10, Adreses atrašanās vieta, modificējama, aktīvaAdreses atrašanās vieta nav FIR10, Adreses atrašanās vieta nav FIR, modificējama, aktīvs Ielas nosaukums10, Ielas nosaukums, modificējams, aktīvs"},{"@language":"mt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"- Indirizz, belt, triq tal-mappa tal-belt kien jikkonsisti mis-sottotipi (sottotipi) li ġejjin fil-klassifikazzjoni tal-informazzjoni 2020 (għal-lista attwali ara l-Ispeċifikazzjoni ġenerali tal-prodott Mappa tal-belt): Post tal-indirizz10, Post tal-indirizz, modifikabbli, post attiv tal-indirizz mhux FIR10, Post tal-indirizz mhux FIR, modifikabbli, isem attiv tat-triq10, Isem tat-triq, modifikabbli, attiv"},{"@language":"nl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Stadskaart - Adres, stad, straat bestond uit de volgende subtypen (subtypen) bij de informatieclassificatie 2020 (voor de huidige lijst zie Algemene productspecificatie Stadskaart): Adreslocatie10, Adreslocatie, aanpasbaar, actiefAdreslocatie niet FIR10, Adreslocatie niet FIR, aanpasbaar, actief Straatnaam10, Straatnaam, aanpasbaar, actief"},{"@language":"pl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Mapa miasta - Adres, miasto, ulica składał się z następujących podtypów (podtypów) w klasyfikacji informacji 2020 (aktualna lista patrz Ogólna specyfikacja produktu Mapa miasta): Lokalizacja adresu10, Lokalizacja adresu, modyfikowalny, aktywny Lokalizacja adresu nie FIR10, Lokalizacja adresu nie FIR, modyfikowalny, aktywny Nazwa ulicy10, Nazwa ulicy, modyfikowalny, aktywny"},{"@language":"pt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Mapa da cidade - Endereço, cidade, rua consistiu nos seguintes subtipos (subtipos) na classificação de informações 2020 (para a lista atual, ver especificação geral do produto Mapa da cidade): Localização do endereço10, Localização do endereço, modificável, activeLocal do endereço não FIR10, Localização do endereço não FIR, modificável, active Nome da rua10, Nome da rua, modificável, ativo"},{"@language":"ro-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Harta orașului - Adresa, orașul, strada a constat din următoarele subtipuri (subtipuri) la clasificarea informațiilor 2020 (pentru lista actuală a se vedea specificațiile generale ale produsului Harta orașului): Adresa locație10, Adresa locație, modificabilă, activăAdresa locație nu FIR10, Adresa locație nu FIR, modificabilă, activă Numele străzii10, Numele străzii, modificabilă, activă"},{"@language":"sk-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Mapa mesta - Adresa, mesto, ulica pozostávala z týchto podtypov (podtypov) v klasifikácii informácií 2020 (pre aktuálny zoznam pozri všeobecnú špecifikáciu výrobku Mestská mapa): Adresa poloha10, Adresa poloha, modifikovateľná, aktívnaAdresa poloha nie FIR10, Adresa poloha nie FIR, modifikovateľná, aktívny názov ulice10, Názov ulice, modifikovateľná, aktívna"},{"@language":"sl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Zemljevid mesta - Naslov, mesto, ulica je bila sestavljena iz naslednjih podtipov (podtipov) pri klasifikaciji informacij 2020 (za trenutni seznam glej Splošno specifikacijo izdelka Zemljevid mesta): Lokacija naslova10, Lokacija naslova, ki jo je mogoče spremeniti, aktivna Lokacija naslova ni FIR10, Lokacija naslova ni FIR, ki jo je mogoče spremeniti, aktivna Ime ulice10, Ime ulice, ki jo je mogoče spremeniti, aktivna"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Stadskarta - Adress, ort, gata bestod av följande undertyper (subtyper) vid informationsklassningen 2020 (för aktuell lista se Allmän produktspecifikation Stadskartan) :Adressplats10, Adressplats, modifierbar, aktivAdressplats ej FIR10, Adressplats ej FIR, modifierbar, aktivGatunamn10, Gatunamn, modifierbar, aktiv"},{"@language":"uk-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Карта міста - Адреса, місто, вулиця складалася з наступних підтипів (підтипів) за інформаційною класифік