hecksumValue":"1e8ba3216b52b2803dd857c603beb2a659"},{"@id":"_:83a79b28d428a965e0d1e2400a3cdc8b1fcd72df6d183145c95d2db764870eb6_b1n0","dct:identifier":"http://data.europa.eu/88u/distribution/8831e6eb-476e-46a2-9e75-9c2a638ef680","foaf:primaryTopic":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/88u/distribution/ba5ef1ed-8d94-49d7-97c4-9f83e5cf594f"}},{"@id":"_:83a79b28d428a965e0d1e2400a3cdc8b1fcd72df6d183145c95d2db764870eb6_b2n0","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Address","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#country-name":"Sverige","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#locality":"Sundsvall","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#postal-code":"851 81","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#street-address":"Stuvarvägen 21"},{"@id":"_:83a79b28d428a965e0d1e2400a3cdc8b1fcd72df6d183145c95d2db764870eb6_b3n0","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Voice","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasValue":{"@id":"tel:+46771670670"}},{"@id":"_:83a79b28d428a965e0d1e2400a3cdc8b1fcd72df6d183145c95d2db764870eb6_b4n0","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasValue":{"@id":"tel:+46771670670"}},{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/88u/dataset/https-metadata-bolagsverket-se-store-2-resource-62~~1","@type":"dcat:Dataset","dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://metadata.bolagsverket.se/store/2/resource/20"},"dcat:distribution":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/88u/distribution/ba5ef1ed-8d94-49d7-97c4-9f83e5cf594f"},"dcat:keyword":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Beneficial owner"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Verklig huvudman"}],"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/ECON"},"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/RESTRICTED"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"bg-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Действителен собственик е лицето или лицата, които в крайна сметка притежават или контролират например дружество или сдружение. Действителен собственик може да бъде и лицето или лицата, които се възползват от някой друг, действащ за тях."},{"@language":"cs-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Skutečný majitel je osoba nebo osoby, které v konečném důsledku vlastní nebo ovládají například společnost nebo sdružení. Skutečný majitel může být také osoba nebo osoby, které mají prospěch z někoho jiného, kdo za ně jedná."},{"@language":"da-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"En reel ejer er den eller de personer, der i sidste ende ejer eller kontrollerer f.eks. et selskab eller en sammenslutning. En reel ejer kan også være den eller de personer, der drager fordel af en anden, der handler for dem."},{"@language":"de-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Ein wirtschaftlicher Eigentümer ist die Person oder Personen, die letztlich beispielsweise ein Unternehmen oder eine Vereinigung besitzen oder kontrollieren. Ein wirtschaftlicher Eigentümer kann auch die Person oder Personen sein, die von einer anderen Person profitieren, die für sie handelt."},{"@language":"el-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Πραγματικός δικαιούχος είναι το πρόσωπο ή τα πρόσωπα που τελικά κατέχουν ή ελέγχουν, για παράδειγμα, μια εταιρεία ή ένωση. Πραγματικός δικαιούχος μπορεί επίσης να είναι το πρόσωπο ή τα πρόσωπα που επωφελούνται από κάποιον άλλο που ενεργεί για λογαριασμό τους."},{"@language":"en-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"A beneficial owner is the person or persons who ultimately own or control, for example, a company or association. A beneficial owner may also be the person or persons who benefit from someone else acting for them."},{"@language":"es-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Un beneficiario efectivo es la persona o personas que en última instancia poseen o controlan, por ejemplo, una empresa o asociación. Un beneficiario efectivo también puede ser la persona o personas que se benefician de que otra persona actúe por ellos."},{"@language":"et-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Tegelik tulusaaja on isik või isikud, kes lõplikult omavad või kontrollivad näiteks äriühingut või ühendust. Tegelik kasusaaja võib olla ka isik või isikud, kes saavad kasu kellegi teise tegevusest."},{"@language":"fi-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Tosiasiallinen omistaja ja edunsaaja on henkilö tai henkilöt, jotka viime kädessä omistavat tai valvovat esimerkiksi yritystä tai yhdistystä. Tosiasiallinen omistaja ja edunsaaja voi olla myös henkilö tai henkilöt, jotka hyötyvät siitä, että joku muu toimii heidän puolestaan."},{"@language":"fr-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Un bénéficiaire effectif est la ou les personnes qui, en fin de compte, possèdent ou contrôlent, par exemple, une entreprise ou une association. Un bénéficiaire effectif peut également être la ou les personnes qui bénéficient de quelqu'un d'autre agissant pour eux."},{"@language":"ga-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Is é úinéir tairbhiúil an duine nó na daoine a bhfuil úinéireacht nó rialú acu ar deireadh, mar shampla, cuideachta nó comhlachas. D'fhéadfadh sé gurb é úinéir tairbhiúil an duine nó na daoine a thairbhíonn de dhuine eile atá ag gníomhú ar a son."},{"@language":"hr-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Stvarni vlasnik je osoba ili osobe koje u konačnici posjeduju ili kontroliraju, na primjer, trgovačko društvo ili udruženje. Stvarni vlasnik može biti i osoba ili osobe koje imaju koristi od druge osobe koja djeluje za njih."},{"@language":"hu-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"A tényleges tulajdonos az a személy vagy személyek, aki vagy akik végső soron tulajdonosa vagy irányítója például egy társaságnak vagy egyesületnek. Tényleges tulajdonos lehet az a személy vagy személyek is, aki vagy akik hasznot húznak abból, ha valaki helyettük jár el."},{"@language":"it-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Un beneficiario effettivo è la persona o le persone che in ultima analisi possiedono o controllano, ad esempio, una società o un'associazione. Un beneficiario effettivo può anche essere la persona o le persone che beneficiano di qualcun altro che agisce per loro."},{"@language":"lt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Tikrasis savininkas yra asmuo ar asmenys, kuriems galiausiai priklauso bendrovė ar asociacija arba kurie jas kontroliuoja. Tikruoju savininku taip pat gali būti asmuo ar asmenys, kurie gauna naudos iš kito asmens, veikiančio jų vardu."},{"@language":"lv-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Faktiskais īpašnieks ir persona vai personas, kurām pilnībā pieder, piemēram, uzņēmums vai apvienība, vai kuras to kontrolē. Faktiskais īpašnieks var būt arī persona vai personas, kas gūst labumu no kāda cita, kas rīkojas to labā."},{"@language":"mt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Sid benefiċjarju huwa l-persuna jew il-persuni li fl-aħħar mill-aħħar jippossjedu jew jikkontrollaw, pereżempju, kumpanija jew assoċjazzjoni. Sid benefiċjarju jista’ jkun ukoll il-persuna jew il-persuni li jibbenefikaw minn xi ħadd ieħor li jaġixxi għalihom."},{"@language":"nl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Een uiteindelijk gerechtigde is de persoon of personen die uiteindelijk eigenaar zijn van of zeggenschap hebben over bijvoorbeeld een vennootschap of vereniging. Een uiteindelijk gerechtigde kan ook de persoon of personen zijn die baat hebben bij iemand anders die voor hen optreedt."},{"@language":"pl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Beneficjent rzeczywisty to osoba lub osoby, które ostatecznie są właścicielami lub kontrolują, na przykład przedsiębiorstwo lub stowarzyszenie. Beneficjentem rzeczywistym może być również osoba lub osoby, które czerpią korzyści z działania na ich rzecz innej osoby."},{"@language":"pt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Um beneficiário efetivo é a pessoa ou pessoas que, em última análise, detêm ou controlam, por exemplo, uma empresa ou associação. Um beneficiário efetivo pode também ser a pessoa ou pessoas que beneficiam de outra pessoa que atua em seu nome."},{"@language":"ro-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Beneficiarul real este persoana sau persoanele care dețin sau controlează în ultimă instanță, de exemplu, o societate sau o asociație. Un beneficiar real poate fi, de asemenea, persoana sau persoanele care beneficiază de pe urma unei alte persoane care acționează în numele lor."},{"@language":"sk-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Konečným užívateľom výhod je osoba alebo osoby, ktoré v konečnom dôsledku vlastnia alebo kontrolujú napríklad spoločnosť alebo združenie. Konečným užívateľom výhod môže byť aj osoba alebo osoby, ktoré majú prospech z toho, že za nich koná niekto iný."},{"@language":"sl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Dejanski lastnik je oseba ali osebe, ki imajo v končni fazi v lasti ali pod nadzorom na primer podjetje ali združenje. Dejanski lastnik je lahko tudi oseba ali osebe, ki imajo koristi od nekoga drugega, ki deluje zanje."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En verklig huvudman är den eller de personer som ytterst äger eller kontrollerar exempelvis ett företag eller en förening. En verklig huvudman kan också vara den eller de personer som tjänar på att någon annan agerar åt dem."},{"@language":"uk-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Бенефіціарним власником є особа або особи, які в кінцевому підсумку володіють або контролюють, наприклад, компанію або асоціацію. Бенефіціарним власником також може бути особа або особи, які отримують вигоду від когось іншого, що діє для них."}],"dct:format":"application/json","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-03-24"},"dct:license":{"@id":"https://dataportal.se/concepts/licensecategories/nolicense"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2021005489"},"dct:spatial":{"@id":"https://sws.geonames.org/2661886"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"bg-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Информация за действителните собственици"},{"@language":"cs-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Informace o skutečných majitelích"},{"@language":"da-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Oplysninger om reelle ejere"},{"@language":"de-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Angaben zu den wirtschaftlichen Eigentümern"},{"@language":"el-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Πληροφορίες σχετικά με τους πραγματικούς δικαιούχους"},{"@language":"en-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Information on beneficial owners"},{"@language":"es-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Información sobre los titulares reales"},{"@language":"et-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Teave tegelike tulusaajate kohta"},{"@language":"fi-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Tosiasiallisia omistajia ja edunsaajia koskevat tiedot"},{"@language":"fr-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Informations sur les bénéficiaires effectifs"},{"@language":"ga-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Faisnéis faoi úinéirí tairbhiúla"},{"@language":"hr-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Informacije o stvarnim vlasnicima"},{"@language":"hu-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"A tényleges tulajdonosokra vonatkozó információk"},{"@language":"it-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Informazioni sui titolari effettivi"},{"@language":"lt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Informacija apie tikruosius savininkus"},{"@language":"lv-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Informācija par faktiskajiem īpašniekiem"},{"@language":"mt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Informazzjoni dwar is-sidien benefiċjarji"},{"@language":"nl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Informatie over uiteindelijke begunstigden"},{"@language":"pl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Informacje o beneficjentach rzeczywistych"},{"@language":"pt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Informações sobre os beneficiários efetivos"},{"@language":"ro-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Informații privind beneficiarii reali"},{"@language":"sk-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Informácie o konečných užívateľoch výhod"},{"@language":"sl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Informacije o dejanskih lastnikih"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Information om verkliga huvudmän"},{"@language":"uk-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Інформація про бенефіціарних власників"}],"http://entryscape.com/terms/servedByDataService":{"@id":"https://metadata.bolagsverket.se/store/2/resource/63"}},{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/88u/distribution/ba5ef1ed-8d94-49d7-97c4-9f83e5cf594f","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://bolagsverket.se/apierochoppnadata/hamtaforetagsinformation/apiforatthamtaforetagsinformation.3988.html"},"dct:format":"application/json","dct:identifier":"https://metadata.bolagsverket.se/store/2/resource/64","dct:title":[{"@language":"bg-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"JSON"},{"@language":"cs-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"JSON"},{"@language":"da-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"JSON"},{"@language":"de-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"JSON"},{"@language":"el-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"ΤΖΣΟΝ"},{"@language":"en-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"JSON"},{"@language":"es-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"JSON"},{"@language":"et-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"JSON"},{"@language":"fi-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"JSON"},{"@language":"fr-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"JSON"},{"@language":"ga-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"JSON"},{"@language":"hr-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"JSON"},{"@language":"hu-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"JSON"},{"@language":"it-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"JSON"},{"@language":"lt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"JSON"},{"@language":"lv-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"JSON"},{"@language":"mt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"JSON"},{"@language":"nl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"JSON"},{"@language":"pl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"JSON"},{"@language":"pt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"JSON"},{"@language":"ro-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"JSON"},{"@language":"sk-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"JSON"},{"@language":"sl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"JSON"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"JSON"},{"@language":"uk-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"JSON"}],"foaf:primaryTopic":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/88u/distribution/8831e6eb-476e-46a2-9e75-9c2a638ef680"},"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability/stable"}},{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/88u/record/https-metadata-bolagsverket-se-store-2-resource-62~~1","@type":"dcat:CatalogRecord","dcat:distribution":[{"@id":"_:83a79b28d428a965e0d1e2400a3cdc8b1fcd72df6d183145c95d2db764870eb6_b1n0"},{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/88u/distribution/ba5ef1ed-8d94-49d7-97c4-9f83e5cf594f"}],"dct:creator":{"@id":"http://piveau.io"},"dct:identifier":"https://metadata.bolagsverket.se/store/2/resource/62","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-05-28T11:15:04Z"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-07-07T20:57:44Z"},"foaf:primaryTopic":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/88u/dataset/https-metadata-bolagsverket-se-store-2-resource-62~~1"},"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksum":{"@id":"_:83a79b28d428a965e0d1e2400a3cdc8b1fcd72df6d183145c95d2db764870eb6_b0n0"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/dqv#hasQualityMetadata":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/88u/metrics/https-metadata-bolagsverket-se-store-2-resource-62~~1"},"https://europeandataportal.eu/voc#originalLanguage":"sv","https://europeandataportal.eu/voc#transIssued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-06-25T11:15:03Z"},"https://europeandataportal.eu/voc#transReceived":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-07-07T20:57:44Z"},"https://europeandataportal.eu/voc#transStatus":{"@id":"https://europeandataportal.eu/voc#TransCompleted"},"https://piveau.eu/ns/voc#originalId":"https://metadata.bolagsverket.se/store/2/resource/62","https://piveau.eu/ns/voc#originalURIRef":"https://metadata.bolagsverket.se/store/2/resource/62"},{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2021005489","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:description":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bolagsverket tillgängliggör datamängder som API:er och XML-paket för företagsinformation och avisering. Avgifter tas ut genom anslutningsavgift och löpande månads- eller årsavgift, beroende på tjänst och transaktioner. Avgiftens storlek varierar, men exempel är: t.ex. 5 000 kr i anslutningsavgift för XML-paket och en transaktionsbaserad löpande avgift; vissa tjänster är kostnadsfria för myndigheter, 250 kr/år för kommuner och regioner."},"dct:identifier":"2021005489","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/NationalAuthority"},"foaf:homepage":{"@id":"https://bolagsverket.se/"},"foaf:mbox":{"@id":"mailto:ssbt@bolagsverket.se"},"foaf:name":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bolagsverket"},"foaf:page":{"@id":"https://www.bolagsverket.se"},"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#sameAs":[{"@id":"https://bolagsverket.se/apierochoppnadata/apiforatthamtaforetagsinformation/dataset#creator"},{"@id":"https://bolagsverket.se/catalog#publisher"},{"@id":"https://bolagsverket.se/ssbtgo/dataset#creator"},{"@id":"https://bolagsverket.se/vardefulla-datamangder-api/dataset#creator"},{"@id":"https://bolagsverket.se/vardefulla-datamangder-bulkfil/dataset#creator"},{"@id":"https://bolagsverket.se/xmlpaket/dataset#creator"},{"@id":"https://metadata.bolagsverket.se/store/36/resource/1"},{"@id":"https://minaombud.se/dataset#creator"},{"@id":"https://www.bolagsverket.se/ssbt/dataset#creator"}],"https://www.w3.org/ns/org#classification":{"@id":"https://dataportal.se/concepts/orgAspects/feeFinanzing"}},{"@id":"https://metadata.bolagsverket.se/store/2/resource/20","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Organization","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"API Bolagsverket","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasAddress":{"@id":"_:83a79b28d428a965e0d1e2400a3cdc8b1fcd72df6d183145c95d2db764870eb6_b2n0"},"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:api@bolagsverket.se"},"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasTelephone":[{"@id":"_:83a79b28d428a965e0d1e2400a3cdc8b1fcd72df6d183145c95d2db764870eb6_b3n0"},{"@id":"_:83a79b28d428a965e0d1e2400a3cdc8b1fcd72df6d183145c95d2db764870eb6_b4n0"}],"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasURL":{"@id":"https://bolagsverket.se/apierochoppnadata/driftochsupport/kontaktaossomapierochoppnadata.3996.html"}},{"@id":"https://metadata.bolagsverket.se/store/2/resource/63","@type":["dcat:DataService","http://entryscape.com/terms/IndependentDataService"],"dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://metadata.bolagsverket.se/store/2/resource/20"},"dcat:endpointDescription":{"@id":"https://portal.api.bolagsverket.se/devportal/apis"},"dcat:endpointURL":{"@id":"https://gw.api.bolagsverket.se/verkliga-huvudman/v1"},"dcat:landingPage":{"@id":"https://bolagsverket.se/apierochoppnadata/hamtaforetagsinformation/apiforatthamtaforetagsinformation.3988.html"},"dcat:servesDataset":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/88u/dataset/https-metadata-bolagsverket-se-store-2-resource-62~~1"},"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/RESTRICTED"},"dct:description":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Genom att skicka in ett organisationsnummer till API:et kan du få information om företagets verkliga huvudmän. Du kan också skicka in ett personnummer till API:et för att få information om alla företag där en person är verklig huvudman."},"dct:title":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Verkliga huvudmän"},"dct:type":{"@id":"http://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q749568"}}],"@id":"urn:source:83a79b28d428a965e0d1e2400a3cdc8b1fcd72df6d183145c95d2db764870eb6"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2021005448","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:identifier":"2021005448","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/NationalAuthority"},"foaf:homepage":{"@id":"https://skatteverket.se"},"foaf:mbox":{"@id":"mailto:robin.mangs@skatteverket.se"},"foaf:name":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Skatteverket"},"foaf:page":{"@id":"https://www.skatteverket.se"},"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#sameAs":[{"@id":"https://skatteverket.entryscape.net/store/29/resource/1"},{"@id":"https://skatteverket.se"}]},{"@id":"https://www7.skatteverket.se/portal/apier-och-oppna-data/utvecklarportalen/api/beskattningsengagemang/1.0.11/%2523dataset","@type":["dcat:Dataset","http://entryscape.com/terms/ServedByDataService"],"dcat:distribution":{"@id":"https://www7.skatteverket.se/portal/apier-och-oppna-data/utvecklarportalen/api/beskattningsengagemang/1.0.11/%2523distribution"},"dcat:keyword":[{"@language":"sv","@value":" avgifter"},{"@language":"sv","@value":" redovisning"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"skatter"}],"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/ECON"},"dcat:version":"1.0","dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/RESTRICTED"},"dct:description":{"@language":"sv","@value":"API:et kan användas av programvaruföretag för att visa uppgifter om F-skatt, arbetsgivarregistrering och momsregistrering. Uppgifterna är bara tillgängliga för enskild näringsidkare eller ensam firmatecknare för företaget som informationen gäller."},"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-10-03"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2021005448"},"dct:title":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Beskattningsengagemang"},"http://entryscape.com/terms/servedByDataService":{"@id":"https://www7.skatteverket.se/portal-wapi/open/apier-och-oppna-data/utvecklarportalen/v1/oas-for-api/beskattningsengagemang/1.0.11/swagger.json%2523accessService"}},{"@id":"https://www7.skatteverket.se/portal/apier-och-oppna-data/utvecklarportalen/api/beskattningsengagemang/1.0.11/%2523distribution","@type":["dcat:Distribution","http://entryscape.com/terms/ServiceDistribution"],"dcat:accessService":{"@id":"https://www7.skatteverket.se/portal-wapi/open/apier-och-oppna-data/utvecklarportalen/v1/oas-for-api/beskattningsengagemang/1.0.11/swagger.json%2523accessService"},"dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://www7.skatteverket.se/portal/apier-och-oppna-data/utvecklarportalen/api/beskattningsengagemang/1.0.11/%C3%96versikt"},"dct:conformsTo":{"@id":"https://www7.skatteverket.se/portal-wapi/open/apier-och-oppna-data/utvecklarportalen/v1/oas-for-api/beskattningsengagemang/1.0.11/swagger.json"},"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/JSON"},"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-10-03"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:title":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Beskattningsengagemang"}}],"@id":"urn:source:8453a5de5a57ddff8c178288ec7e76dd2ec2b6de99bff72be9fdf70d45cbba81"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:846149bf283adc599bf4e4b4d09184ebeebd95a725009c8c26870e21361bd505_b0n0","@type":"dct:Location","dcat:bbox":{"@type":"http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral","@value":"POLYGON((17.7605 59.4426,18.2011 59.4426,18.2011 59.2272,17.7605 59.2272,17.7605 59.4426))"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/locn#geometry":{"@type":"http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral","@value":"POLYGON((17.7605 59.4426,18.2011 59.4426,18.2011 59.2272,17.7605 59.2272,17.7605 59.4426))"}},{"@id":"_:846149bf283adc599bf4e4b4d09184ebeebd95a725009c8c26870e21361bd505_b1n0","@type":"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#Checksum","http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#algorithm":{"@id":"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksumAlgorithm_md5"},"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksumValue":"154be4beb2754cf61693c8bc23fc698394"},{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/88u/dataset/fddcb042-f88f-4501-9671-9714714dbe97","@type":["dcat:Dataset","dcat:dataset"],"dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://resources.stockholm.se/metadata#vcard/Stockholms+stad+-+Milj%C3%B6f%C3%B6rvaltningen/"},"dcat:distribution":[{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/88u/distribution/4582070e-be30-4d46-b307-8d80426ddad6"},{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/88u/distribution/a5cef749-bb9f-49d8-80bd-e1cb77f988b4"}],"dcat:keyword":[{"@language":"sv","@value":"Extern dataportal"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Fullständiga metadata"}],"dcat:landingPage":{"@id":"https://dataportalen.stockholm.se/dataportalen/GetMetaDataById?id=Miljodata0013"},"dcat:theme":[{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/ENVI"},{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/SOCI"}],"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/RESTRICTED"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/IRREG"},"dct:created":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"1997-12-31"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"bg-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Резултати от проучването на IVL на медни покриви в Стокхолм, Солна и Сундбиберг въз основа на цифрови IR въздушни изображения от 1997 г. Допълнителна информация: Картографиране на медни покриви в Стокхолм, Солна и Сундбиберг с цифрови въздушни изображения. Sam Ekstrand et.al. (Сам Екстранд и др.) Доклад за IVL. Стокхолм, октомври 1997 г."},{"@language":"cs-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Výsledky průzkumu měděných střech IVL ve Stockholmu, Solně a Sundbybergu na základě digitálních IR leteckých snímků z roku 1997. Další informace: Mapování měděných střech ve Stockholmu, Solně a Sundbybergu pomocí digitálních leteckých snímků. Sam Ekstrand a další. Zpráva o IVL. Stockholm, říjen 1997."},{"@language":"da-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Resultater fra IVL's kortlægning af kobbertage i Stockholm, Solna og Sundbyberg baseret på digitale IR-antennebilleder fra 1997. Yderligere oplysninger: Kortlægning af kobbertage i Stockholm, Solna og Sundbyberg med digitale luftfotos. Sam Ekstrand et.al. IVL-rapporten. Stockholm, oktober 1997."},{"@language":"de-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Ergebnisse der IVL-Vermessung von Kupferdächern in Stockholm, Solna und Sundbyberg basierend auf digitalen IR-Luftbildern aus dem Jahr 1997. Zusätzliche Informationen: Kartierung von Kupferdächern in Stockholm, Solna und Sundbyberg mit digitalen Luftbildern. Sam Ekstrand et.al. IVL-Bericht. Stockholm, im Oktober 1997."},{"@language":"el-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Αποτελέσματα από την έρευνα IVL των στεγών χαλκού στη Στοκχόλμη, Solna και Sundbyberg με βάση τις ψηφιακές εναέριες εικόνες IR από το 1997. Συμπληρωματικές πληροφορίες: Χαρτογράφηση των στεγών χαλκού στη Στοκχόλμη, Solna και Sundbyberg με ψηφιακές εναέριες εικόνες. Sam Ekstrand et.al. (στα Αγγλικά). Έκθεση IVL. Στοκχόλμη, Οκτώβριος 1997."},{"@language":"en-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Results from IVL's survey of copper roofs in Stockholm, Solna and Sundbyberg based on digital IR aerial images from 1997. Additional information: Mapping of copper roofs in Stockholm, Solna and Sundbyberg with digital aerial images. Sam Ekstrand et.al. IVL Report. Stockholm, October 1997."},{"@language":"es-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Resultados de la encuesta de IVL de techos de cobre en Estocolmo, Solna y Sundbyberg basada en imágenes aéreas IR digitales de 1997. Información adicional: Mapeo de techos de cobre en Estocolmo, Solna y Sundbyberg con imágenes aéreas digitales. Sam Ekstrand y otros Informe IVL. Estocolmo, octubre de 1997."},{"@language":"et-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"IVLi Stockholmi, Solna ja Sundbybergi vaskkatuste uuringu tulemused, mis põhinevad 1997. aasta digitaalsetel IR-antennipiltidel. Lisateave: Vaskkatuste kaardistamine Stockholmis, Solnas ja Sundbybergis digitaalsete aerofotodega. Sam Ekstrand et.al. IVL aruanne. Stockholm, oktoober 1997."},{"@language":"fi-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Tulokset IVL:n kuparikattotutkimuksesta Tukholmassa, Solnassa ja Sundbybergissä perustuen digitaalisiin IR-antennikuviin vuodelta 1997. Lisätietoja: Kuparikattojen kartoitus Tukholmassa, Solnassa ja Sundbybergissä digitaalisilla ilmakuvilla. Sam Ekstrand et.al. IVL-raportti. Tukholma, lokakuu 1997."},{"@language":"fr-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Résultats de l'enquête d'IVL sur les toits en cuivre à Stockholm, Solna et Sundbyberg sur la base d'images aériennes IR numériques de 1997. Informations complémentaires: Cartographie des toits en cuivre à Stockholm, Solna et Sundbyberg avec des images aériennes numériques. Sam Ekstrand et al. Rapport IVL. Stockholm, octobre 1997."},{"@language":"ga-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Torthaí ó shuirbhé IVL ar dhíonta copair i Stócólm, Solna agus Sundbyberg bunaithe ar íomhánna ón aer digiteach IR ó 1997. Faisnéis bhreise: Díonta copair a mhapáil i Stócólm, Solna agus Sundbyberg le haeríomhánna digiteacha. Sam Ekstrand et.al. Tuarascáil IVL. Stócólm, Deireadh Fómhair 1997."},{"@language":"hr-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Rezultati IVL-ovog istraživanja bakrenih krovova u Stockholmu, Solni i Sundbybergu na temelju digitalnih IR zračnih snimaka iz 1997. godine. Dodatne informacije: Mapiranje bakrenih krovova u Stockholmu, Solni i Sundbybergu s digitalnim slikama iz zraka. Sam Ekstrand et.al. Izvješće IVL-a. Stockholm, listopad 1997."},{"@language":"hu-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Az IVL stockholmi, Solna-i és Sundbyberg-i réztetők felmérése az 1997-es digitális IR légi felvételek alapján. További információk: Réztetők feltérképezése Stockholmban, Solnában és Sundbybergben digitális légi felvételekkel. Sam Ekstrand és társai. IVL jelentés. Stockholm, 1997. október."},{"@language":"it-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"I risultati dell'indagine di IVL sui tetti in rame a Stoccolma, Solna e Sundbyberg si basano su immagini aeree IR digitali del 1997. Ulteriori informazioni: Mappatura dei tetti in rame a Stoccolma, Solna e Sundbyberg con immagini aeree digitali. Sam Ekstrand et.al. Relazione IVL. Stoccolma, ottobre 1997."},{"@language":"lt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"IVL atliktos varinių stogų Stokholme, Solnoje ir Sundbyberge apklausos, pagrįstos 1997 m. skaitmeniniais IR aeronuotraukomis, rezultatai. Papildoma informacija: Varinių stogų kartografavimas Stokholme, Solnoje ir Sundbyberge su skaitmeniniais vaizdais iš oro. Sam Ekstrand et.al. IVL ataskaita. Stokholmas, 1997 m. spalio mėn."},{"@language":"lv-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Rezultāti, kas gūti IVL veiktajā vara jumtu apsekojumā Stokholmā, Solnā un Sundbybergā, pamatojoties uz 1997. gada digitālajiem IR gaisa attēliem. Papildu informācija: Vara jumtu kartēšana Stokholmā, Solnā un Sundbybergā ar digitāliem gaisa attēliem. Sam Ekstrand et.al. IVL ziņojums. Stokholmā, 1997. gada oktobrī."},{"@language":"mt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Riżultati mill-istħarriġ tal-IVL dwar is-soqfa tar-ram fi Stokkolma, Solna u Sundbyberg ibbażat fuq immaġnijiet diġitali tal-ajru IR mill-1997. Informazzjoni addizzjonali: Immappjar tas-soqfa tar-ram fi Stokkolma, Solna u Sundbyberg b’immaġnijiet diġitali mill-ajru. Sam Ekstrand et.al. Rapport IVL. Stokkolma, Ottubru 1997."},{"@language":"nl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Resultaten van IVL's onderzoek naar koperen daken in Stockholm, Solna en Sundbyberg op basis van digitale IR-luchtfoto's uit 1997. Aanvullende informatie: Het in kaart brengen van koperen daken in Stockholm, Solna en Sundbyberg met digitale luchtfoto's. Sam Ekstrand et.al. IVL-verslag. Stockholm, oktober 1997."},{"@language":"pl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Wyniki badania dachów miedzianych przeprowadzonego przez IVL w Sztokholmie, Solnie i Sundbybergu na podstawie cyfrowych zdjęć lotniczych na podczerwień z 1997 r. Dodatkowe informacje: Mapowanie dachów miedzianych w Sztokholmie, Solnie i Sundbybergu za pomocą cyfrowych zdjęć lotniczych. Sam Ekstrand et.al. (ang.). Sprawozdanie IVL. Sztokholm, październik 1997 r."},{"@language":"pt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Resultados do levantamento da IVL de telhados de cobre em Estocolmo, Solna e Sundbyberg com base em imagens aéreas de infravermelhos digitais de 1997. Informações adicionais: Mapeamento de telhados de cobre em Estocolmo, Solna e Sundbyberg com imagens aéreas digitais. Sam Ekstrand et.al. Relatório IVL. Estocolmo, Outubro de 1997."},{"@language":"ro-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Rezultatele studiului IVL privind acoperișurile din cupru din Stockholm, Solna și Sundbyberg, bazate pe imagini aeriene digitale IR din 1997. Informații suplimentare: Cartografierea acoperișurilor din cupru din Stockholm, Solna și Sundbyberg cu imagini aeriene digitale. Sam Ekstrand și alții. Raportul IVL. Stockholm, octombrie 1997."},{"@language":"sk-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Výsledky prieskumu spoločnosti IVL týkajúceho sa medených striech v Štokholme, Solne a Sundbybergu na základe digitálnych infračervených leteckých snímok z roku 1997. Doplňujúce informácie: Mapovanie medených striech v Štokholme, Solne a Sundbybergu pomocou digitálnych leteckých snímok. Sam Ekstrand et.al. Správa IVL. Štokholm, október 1997."},{"@language":"sl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Rezultati IVL-ove raziskave bakrenih streh v Stockholmu, Solni in Sundbybergu na podlagi digitalnih IR aerofotografij iz leta 1997. Dodatne informacije: Kartiranje bakrenih streh v Stockholmu, Solni in Sundbybergu z digitalnimi posnetki iz zraka. Sam Ekstrand et.al. Poročilo IVL. Stockholm, oktober 1997."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Resultat från IVLs kartläggning av koppartak i Stockholm, Solna och Sundbyberg utifrån digitala IR-flygbilder från 1997. Ytterligare information: Kartläggning av koppartak i Stockholm, Solna och Sundbyberg med digitala flygbilder. Sam Ekstrand et.al. IVL-Rapport. Stockholm, oktober 1997."},{"@language":"uk-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Результати обстеження мідних покрівель IVL у Стокгольмі, Солні та Сундбіберзі на основі цифрових інфрачервоних аерофотознімків 1997 року. Додаткова інформація: Картування мідних дахів у Стокгольмі, Солні та Сундбіберзі за допомогою цифрових аерофотознімків. Сем Екстранд та ін. IVL Report (англ.). Стокгольм, жовтень 1997 року."}],"dct:format":"text/html","dct:identifier":"fddcb042-f88f-4501-9671-9714714dbe97","dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"https://dataportal.se/concepts/licensecategories/otherlicense"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2120000142"},"dct:spatial":{"@id":"_:846149bf283adc599bf4e4b4d09184ebeebd95a725009c8c26870e21361bd505_b0n0"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"bg-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Коппартак"},{"@language":"cs-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Koppartak"},{"@language":"da-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Koppartak"},{"@language":"de-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Koppartak"},{"@language":"el-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Κοππαρτάκ"},{"@language":"en-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Koppartak"},{"@language":"es-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Koppartak"},{"@language":"et-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Koppartak"},{"@language":"fi-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Koppartak"},{"@language":"fr-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Koppartak"},{"@language":"ga-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Koppartak"},{"@language":"hr-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Koppartak"},{"@language":"hu-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Koppartak"},{"@language":"it-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Koppartak"},{"@language":"lt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Koppartak"},{"@language":"lv-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Koppartak"},{"@language":"mt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Koppartak"},{"@language":"nl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Koppartak"},{"@language":"pl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Koppartak"},{"@language":"pt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Koppartak"},{"@language":"ro-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Koppartak"},{"@language":"sk-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Koppartak"},{"@language":"sl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Koppartak"},