dukta pilsētas kartē Stockholm County"},{"@language":"mt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Is-sett ta’ data huwa inkluż fil-mappa tal-prodott tal-Belt tal-Kontea ta’ Stokkolma"},{"@language":"nl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"De dataset is opgenomen in het product Stadskaart Stockholm County"},{"@language":"pl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Zbiór danych znajduje się w produkcie Mapa miasta Stockholm County"},{"@language":"pt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"O conjunto de dados está incluído no produto Mapa da cidade Condado de Estocolmo"},{"@language":"ro-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Setul de date este inclus în produsul Harta orașului Stockholm County"},{"@language":"sk-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Súbor údajov je súčasťou produktu Mapa mesta Štokholmská župa"},{"@language":"sl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Nabor podatkov je vključen v izdelek Zemljevid mesta Stockholm County"},{"@language":"uk-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Набір даних включений в продукт Карта міста Стокгольмського повіту"}],"foaf:primaryTopic":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/88u/distribution/149a78b2-0bed-4093-937c-8d60db6e4218"}},{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/88u/record/ca578cd5-705b-4323-8718-a41f6a7f1a43","@type":"dcat:CatalogRecord","dcat:distribution":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/88u/distribution/149a78b2-0bed-4093-937c-8d60db6e4218"},"dct:creator":{"@id":"http://piveau.io"},"dct:identifier":"ca578cd5-705b-4323-8718-a41f6a7f1a43","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2025-03-06T09:38:10Z"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-07-03T08:45:57Z"},"foaf:primaryTopic":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/88u/dataset/ca578cd5-705b-4323-8718-a41f6a7f1a43"},"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksum":{"@id":"_:99852e3b17c68a7a00fb32de984566af2d345fdd0ed624898bb300cb18dad0e2_b1n0"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/dqv#hasQualityMetadata":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/88u/metrics/ca578cd5-705b-4323-8718-a41f6a7f1a43"},"https://europeandataportal.eu/voc#originalLanguage":"sv","https://europeandataportal.eu/voc#transIssued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":