":"SBK Baskarta - Byggnadsanläggningar"},{"@language":"uk-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"СБК Базова карта - Будівлі та споруди"}],"dct:type":{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/ResourceType/dataset"}},{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/88u/distribution/b5fa842f-c180-4c2f-883f-8465b0a780fd","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://dataportalen.stockholm.se/dataportalen/?query=748573062_Dataportalen_EnkelVy_resultset&loc=sv&SplashScreen=no"},"dct:format":"text/html","dct:identifier":"https://resources.stockholm.se/data/8d6e25de-d393-4346-8a68-12750a433f7b#HTTP:Information/1","dct:title":["Datamängden ingår i produkten Baskarta (1:400  - 1:2000).",{"@language":"bg-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Наборът от данни е включен в продуктовата базова карта (1:400 - 1:2000)."},{"@language":"cs-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Datový soubor je součástí produktové Základní mapy (1:400 - 1:2000)."},{"@language":"da-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Datasættet er inkluderet i produktbasen (1:400 - 1:2000)."},{"@language":"de-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Der Datensatz ist im Produkt Basiskarte (1:400 - 1:2000) enthalten."},{"@language":"el-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Το σύνολο δεδομένων περιλαμβάνεται στον χάρτη βάσης προϊόντος (1:400 - 1:2000)."},{"@language":"en-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"The data set is included in the product Base map (1:400 - 1:2000)."},{"@language":"es-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"El conjunto de datos se incluye en el mapa base del producto (1:400 - 1:2000)."},{"@language":"et-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Andmekogum sisaldub toote aluskaardil (1:400 - 1:2000)."},{"@language":"fi-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Aineisto sisältyy tuotteen peruskarttaan (1:400 - 1:2000)."},{"@language":"fr-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"L'ensemble de données est inclus dans la carte de base du produit (1:400 - 1:2000)."},{"@language":"ga-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Tá an tacar sonraí san áireamh sa bhunléarscáil táirge (1:400 - 1:2000)."},{"@language":"hr-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Skup podataka uključen je u kartu proizvoda Baza (1:400 - 1:2000)."},{"@language":"hu-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Az adatkészlet megtalálható a termék alaptérképén (1:400 - 1:2000)."},{"@language":"it-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Il set di dati è incluso nella mappa di base del prodotto (1:400 - 1:2000)."},{"@language":"lt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Duomenų rinkinys įtrauktas į gaminio bazinį žemėlapį (1:400 - 1:2000)."},{"@language":"lv-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Datu kopa ir iekļauta produktu bāzes kartē (1:400 - 1:2000)."},{"@language":"mt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Is-sett tad-data huwa inkluż fil-mappa tal-bażi tal-prodott (1:400 - 1:2000)."},{"@language":"nl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"De gegevensset is opgenomen in de productbasiskaart (1:400 - 1:2000)."},{"@language":"pl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Zbiór danych znajduje się na mapie bazowej produktu (1:400 - 1:2000)."},{"@language":"pt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"O conjunto de dados está incluído no mapa de base do produto (1:400 - 1:2000)."},{"@language":"ro-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Setul de date este inclus în harta de bază a produsului (1:400 - 1:2000)."},{"@language":"sk-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Dátový súbor je súčasťou produktu Základná mapa (1:400 - 1:2000)."},{"@language":"sl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Nabor podatkov je vključen v osnovni zemljevid izdelka (1:400 - 1:2000)."},{"@language":"uk-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Набір даних входить до базової карти продукту (1:400 - 1:2000)."}],"foaf:primaryTopic":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/88u/distribution/b5fa842f-c180-4c2f-883f-8465b0a780fd"}},{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/88u/record/8d6e25de-d393-4346-8a68-12750a433f7b","@type":"dcat:CatalogRecord","dcat:distribution":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/88u/distribution/b5fa842f-c180-4c2f-883f-8465b0a780fd"},"dct:creator":{"@id":"http://piveau.io"},"dct:identifier":"8d6e25de-d393-4346-8a68-12750a433f7b","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-03-20T11:15:02Z"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-07-03T08:40:15Z"},"foaf:primaryTopic":{"@id":"http://data.europ