odukta pilsētas kartē Stockholm County"},{"@language":"mt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Is-sett ta’ data huwa inkluż fil-mappa tal-prodott tal-Belt tal-Kontea ta’ Stokkolma"},{"@language":"nl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"De dataset is opgenomen in het product Stadskaart Stockholm County"},{"@language":"pl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Zbiór danych znajduje się w produkcie Mapa miasta Stockholm County"},{"@language":"pt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"O conjunto de dados está incluído no produto Mapa da cidade Condado de Estocolmo"},{"@language":"ro-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Setul de date este inclus în produsul Harta orașului Stockholm County"},{"@language":"sk-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Súbor údajov je súčasťou produktu Mapa mesta Štokholmská župa"},{"@language":"sl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Nabor podatkov je vključen v izdelek Zemljevid mesta Stockholm County"},{"@language":"uk-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Набір даних включений в продукт Карта міста Стокгольмського повіту"}],"foaf:primaryTopic":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/88u/distribution/b7afaad3-fe68-4648-a52a-62b1d0522507"}},{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/88u/record/a3cc76f2-8c08-499f-856e-407f6799ca6b","@type":"dcat:CatalogRecord","dcat:distribution":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/88u/distribution/b7afaad3-fe68-4648-a52a-62b1d0522507"},"dct:creator":{"@id":"http://piveau.io"},"dct:identifier":"a3cc76f2-8c08-499f-856e-407f6799ca6b","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2025-03-06T09:38:37Z"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-07-03T08:42:38Z"},"foaf:primaryTopic":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/88u/dataset/a3cc76f2-8c08-499f-856e-407f6799ca6b"},"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksum":{"@id":"_:c2cb8c770302b844266805a3e3118e9e088271c1dc6f1fe19fff961275cde3d2_b1n0"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/dqv#hasQualityMetadata":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/88u/metrics/a3cc76f2-8c08-499f-856e-407f6799ca6b"},"https://europeandataportal.eu/voc#originalLanguage":"sv","https://europeandataportal.eu/voc#transIssued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value"