tenantrag"},{"@language":"el-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Εφαρμογή χάρτη"},{"@language":"en-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Map application"},{"@language":"es-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Aplicación de mapas"},{"@language":"et-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Kaardirakendus"},{"@language":"fi-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Karttasovellus"},{"@language":"fr-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Application de la carte"},{"@language":"ga-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Feidhmchlár léarscáile"},{"@language":"hr-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Aplikacija zemljovida"},{"@language":"hu-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Térképes alkalmazás"},{"@language":"it-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Applicazione della mappa"},{"@language":"lt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Žemėlapio taikomoji programa"},{"@language":"lv-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Kartes pieteikums"},{"@language":"mt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Applikazzjoni tal-mappa"},{"@language":"nl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Kaarttoepassing"},{"@language":"pl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Aplikacja mapowa"},{"@language":"pt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Aplicação de mapas"},{"@language":"ro-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Aplicație pentru hărți"},{"@language":"sk-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Aplikácia máp"},{"@language":"sl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Aplikacija zemljevida"},{"@language":"uk-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Додаток для мап"}],"foaf:primaryTopic":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/88u/distribution/57bf3f8e-e35e-42f3-a253-021fa99619c4"}},{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/88u/distribution/f18e9343-f329-47a3-a8fc-5141933c12ac","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://open-data-sthlm-miljo.hub.arcgis.com/maps/96458f2922214cada3f205863f2c1d95/about"},"dct:format":"text/html","dct:identifier":"https://resources.stockholm.se/data/c2638d28-809c-4df4-b131-3756f1cedf5f#HTTP:ESRI+Portal-URL/1","dct:title":["Miljöförvaltningens öppna data-hub",{"@language":"bg-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Център за отворени данни на администрацията по околна среда"},{"@language":"cs-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Rozbočovač otevřených dat správy životního prostředí"},{"@language":"da-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Miljøstyrelsens åbne datahub"},{"@language":"de-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Open Data Hub der Umweltverwaltung"},{"@language":"el-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Κόμβος ανοικτών δεδομένων της περιβαλλοντικής διοίκησης"},{"@language":"en-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Environmental administration's open data hub"},{"@language":"es-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Centro de datos abiertos de la administración ambiental"},{"@language":"et-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Keskkonnaameti avatud andmete keskus"},{"@language":"fi-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Ympäristöhallinnon avoimen datan keskus"},{"@language":"fr-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Pôle de données ouvertes de l'administration environnementale"},{"@language":"ga-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Mol sonraí oscailte an riaracháin comhshaoil"},{"@language":"hr-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Centar otvorenih podataka uprave za okoliš"},{"@language":"hu-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"A környezetvédelmi igazgatás nyílt adatközpontja"},{"@language":"it-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"L'hub open data dell'amministrazione ambientale"},{"@language":"lt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Aplinkos apsaugos administracijos atvirųjų duomenų centras"},{"@language":"lv-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Vides pārvaldes atvērto datu centrs"},{"@language":"mt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Ċentru tad-data miftuħa tal-amministrazzjoni ambjentali"},{"@language":"nl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Open data hub van de milieuadministratie"},{"@language":"pl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Otwarte centrum danych administracji środowiskowej"},{"@language":"pt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Centro de dados abertos da administração ambiental"},{"@language":"ro-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Centrul de date deschise al administrației de mediu"},{"@language":"sk-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Centrum otvorených dát environmentálnej správy"},{"@language":"sl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Vozlišče odprtih podatkov okoljske uprave"},{"@language":"uk-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Центр відкритих даних екологічної адміністрації"}],"foaf:primaryTopic":{"@id":"http:/