ειες ιδιοτήτων που δημιουργούνται από τα όρια ιδιοτήτων"},{"@language":"en-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"3D property surfaces generated from property boundaries"},{"@language":"es-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Superficies de propiedad 3D generadas a partir de límites de propiedad"},{"@language":"et-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Omandipiiridest loodud 3D-kinnisvarapinnad"},{"@language":"fi-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Kiinteistörajoista syntyvät 3D-kiinteistöpinnat"},{"@language":"fr-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Surfaces de propriété 3D générées à partir des limites de propriété"},{"@language":"ga-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Dromchlaí maoine 3T a ghintear ó theorainneacha maoine"},{"@language":"hr-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"3D površine nekretnina nastale iz granica nekretnina"},{"@language":"hu-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Ingatlanhatárokból generált 3D-s ingatlanfelületek"},{"@language":"it-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Superfici di proprietà 3D generate dai confini delle proprietà"},{"@language":"lt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Nuosavybės ribose susidarę 3D nuosavybės paviršiai"},{"@language":"lv-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"3D rekvizītu virsmas, kas radītas no rekvizītu robežām"},{"@language":"mt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Superfiċi tal-proprjetà 3D iġġenerati mil-limiti tal-proprjetà"},{"@language":"nl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"3D-eigenschapsoppervlakken gegenereerd uit eigendomsgrenzen"},{"@language":"pl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Powierzchnie nieruchomości 3D generowane z granic nieruchomości"},{"@language":"pt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Superfícies da propriedade 3D geradas a partir dos limites da propriedade"},{"@language":"ro-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Suprafețe de proprietate 3D generate de limitele proprietății"},{"@language":"sk-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"3D povrchy nehnuteľností generované z hraníc nehnuteľností"},{"@language":"sl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"3D-površine nepremičnin, ustvarjene z mejami nepremičnin"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"3D-fastighetsytor genererade från fastighetsgränserna"},{"@language":"uk-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"3D-поверхні властивостей, створені з меж власності"}],"dct:identifier":"ds_rk_3dfastighet_y","dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"https://dataportal.se/concepts/licensecategories/nolicense"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2120000068"},"dct:spatial":{"@id":"http://sws.geonames.org/2704619"},"dct:subject":[{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/TopicCategory/boundaries"},{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/TopicCategory/planningCadastre"}],"dct:title":[{"@language":"bg-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"3D недвижими имоти (повърхности)"},{"@language":"cs-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"3D nemovitosti (povrchy)"},{"@language":"da-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"3D fast ejendom (overflader)"},{"@language":"de-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"3D-Immobilien (Oberflächen)"},{"@language":"el-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"3D ακίνητα (επιφάνειες)"},{"@language":"en-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"3D real estate (surfaces)"},{"@language":"es-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Bienes inmuebles en 3D (superficies)"},{"@language":"et-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"3D kinnisvara (pinnad)"},{"@language":"fi-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"3D-kiinteistöt (pinnat)"},{"@language":"fr-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Immobilier 3D (surfaces)"},{"@language":"ga-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Réadmhaoin 3D (dromchlaí)"},{"@language":"hr-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"3D nekretnine (površine)"},{"@language":"hu-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"3D ingatlan (felületek)"},{"@language":"it-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Immobili 3D (superfici)"},{"@language":"lt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"3D nekilnojamasis turtas (paviršiai)"},{"@language":"lv-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"3D nekustamais īpašums (virsmas)"},{"@language":"mt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Proprjetà immobbli 3D (uċuħ)"},{"@language":"nl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"3D vastgoed (oppervlakten)"},{"@language":"pl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Nieruchomości 3D (powierzchnie)"},{"@language":"pt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Imóveis 3D (superfícies)"},{"@language":"ro-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Imobiliare 3D (suprafețe)"},{"@language":"sk-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"3D nehnuteľnosti (povrchy)"},{"@language":"sl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"3D nepremičnine (površine)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"3D-fastigheter (ytor)"},{"@language":"uk-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"3D-нерухомість (поверхні)"}],"http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#qualifiedAttribution":{"@id":"_:ca8072abfcb771ef51056b61e8ad1b7395c196c098604d9387b8fac886276841_b0n0"}},{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/88u/distribution/658f5f5b-63be-4830-a92c-06aab8cbd7a6","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://csm.huddinge.sokigohosting.com/spatialmap?mapheight=840&mapwidth=1689&label=&ignorefavorite=true&profile=huddinge_internkarta&selectorgroups=fastigheter+ortofoto+parkskotsel_upphandling_2022+maxbuller+dygnsbuller+arrenden_nyttjanderatter_och_master_mex_inkl_avtal&layers=cartesia-lmvtopodim-direkt+theme-3d_fastigheter_ytor&opacities=1+1&mapext=127852.39203541739+6557337.278319392+166442.3852959111+6576471.865238937&maprotation="},"dct:title":[{"@language":"bg-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Карта на сайта"},{"@language":"cs-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Mapa stránek"},{"@language":"da-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Sitemap"},{"@language":"de-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Sitemap"},{"@language":"el-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Χάρτης ιστότοπου"},{"@language":"en-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Sitemap"},{"@language":"es-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Mapa del sitio"},{"@language":"et-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Tegevuskoha kaart"},{"@language":"fi-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Sivukartta"},{"@language":"fr-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Plan du site"},{"@language":"ga-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Léarscáil an tSuímh"},{"@language":"hr-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Karta web-mjesta"},{"@language":"hu-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Oldaltérkép"},{"@language":"it-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Mappa del sito"},{"@language":"lt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Svetainės struktūra"},{"@language":"lv-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Vietnes karte"},{"@language":"mt-t