om långsiktig miljöövervakning. Målet är att alla sjöar, vattendrag och kustvatten ska ha god ekologisk och kemisk status senast år 2027 enligt EU:s vattendirektiv."},"dct:identifier":"f972cca1-a5c9-4b02-889b-508651e11cb0","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-05-08"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-05-08"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2120000142"},"dct:spatial":{"@id":"_:ef40cd29edc6cc8f964c033cb961dc0dd70ca2f3977cf323c6103bcf69e67753_b0n0"},"dct:title":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Indikatordata Vatten - MiljödataStockholm"},"dct:type":{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/ResourceType/dataset"}},{"@id":"https://resources.stockholm.se/data/f972cca1-a5c9-4b02-889b-508651e11cb0#HTTP:ESRI+Portal-URL/2","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://open-data-sthlm-miljo.hub.arcgis.com/maps/648e41e4935744768ded37bb3d8f072e/about"},"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/HTML"},"dct:title":"Miljöförvaltningen öppna data-hub"},{"@id":"https://resources.stockholm.se/data/f972cca1-a5c9-4b02-889b-508651e11cb0#HTTP:Information/1","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://www.miljodatastockholm.se/vatten/"},"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/HTML"},"dct:title":"MiljödataStockholm"},{"@id":"https://resources.stockholm.se/metadata#vcard/Stockholms+stad+-+Milj%C3%B6f%C3%B6rvaltningen/","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Organization","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Stockholms stad - Miljöförvaltningen"},"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:mgis@stockholm.se"}}],"@id":"urn:source:ef40cd29edc6cc8f964c033cb961dc0dd70ca2f3977cf323c6103bcf69e67753"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:f055d72725890c0c6d021655da9aad62bc28f6ef97be663260202b03d737730d_b0n0","@type":"dc