 tal-bażi tal-prodott (1:400 - 1:2000)."},{"@language":"nl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"De gegevensset is opgenomen in de productbasiskaart (1:400 - 1:2000)."},{"@language":"pl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Zbiór danych znajduje się na mapie bazowej produktu (1:400 - 1:2000)."},{"@language":"pt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"O conjunto de dados está incluído no mapa de base do produto (1:400 - 1:2000)."},{"@language":"ro-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Setul de date este inclus în harta de bază a produsului (1:400 - 1:2000)."},{"@language":"sk-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Dátový súbor je súčasťou produktu Základná mapa (1:400 - 1:2000)."},{"@language":"sl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Nabor podatkov je vključen v osnovni zemljevid izdelka (1:400 - 1:2000)."},{"@language":"uk-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Набір даних входить до базової карти продукту (1:400 - 1:2000)."}],"foaf:primaryTopic":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/88u/distribution/101d9a1e-d737-4f22-8ad4-7302baf3e26d"}},{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/88u/record/124db2a1-44ec-41b9-8889-181b14f4bff0","@type":"dcat:CatalogRecord","dcat:distribution":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/88u/distribution/101d9a1e-d737-4f22-8ad4-7302baf3e26d"},"dct:creator":{"@id":"http://piveau.io"},"dct:identifier":"124db2a1-44ec-41b9-8889-181b14f4bff0","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-03-20T11:15:05Z"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-07-03T08:43:04Z"},"foaf:primaryTopic":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/88u/dataset/124db2a1-44ec-41b9-8889-181b14f4bff0"},"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksum":{"@id":"_:f401db96c31ae4f8bf7eaff4b4c77f9cfae29dacc3cf9a8255f732ce2fe4cb7f_b1n0"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/dqv#hasQualityMetadata":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/88u/metrics/124db2a1-44ec-41b9-8889-181b14f4bff0"},"https://europeandataportal.eu/voc#originalLanguage":"sv","https://europeandataportal.eu/voc#transIssued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-06-07T11:15:04Z"},"https://europeandataportal.eu/voc#transReceived":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-0